(836076, 95000, 14620, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge!  Love the lighting and how the back dissolves into the background.  The details of the face are pristine and the B&amp;W tones and composition are spot on.  The eye speaks for itself.  Bravo!</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge!  Love the lighting and how the back dissolves into the background.  The details of the face are pristine and the B&W tones and composition are spot on.  The eye speaks for itself.  Bravo!', '2004-08-02 01:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
