(836158, 95018, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice...very nice.  10. Good luck with this one mate!</td>', 'Nice...very nice.  10. Good luck with this one mate!', '2004-08-02 01:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(836160, 95331, 6008, '<td valign="top">The blue is subtle but works. Love the air bubbles, I think that really makes the image for me. No idea how much control you had on this shot, but in a perfect world I''d love to see the blue tiled line go diagonally across the frame and also have her almost mirroring the line with an elongated body instead of her current pose. The light patterns on the bottom of the pool is neat.</td>', 'The blue is subtle but works. Love the air bubbles, I think that really makes the image for me. No idea how much control you had on this shot, but in a perfect world I''d love to see the blue tiled line go diagonally across the frame and also have her almost mirroring the line with an elongated body instead of her current pose. The light patterns on the bottom of the pool is neat.', '2004-08-02 01:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(836164, 94724, 22656, '<td valign="top">Exelent</td>', 'Exelent', '2004-08-02 01:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(836165, 94551, 19425, '<td valign="top">Looks sorta greenish on my monitor. Is that on purpose?</td>', 'Looks sorta greenish on my monitor. Is that on purpose?', '2004-08-02 01:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(836166, 95203, 22496, '<td valign="top">Boooooo</td>', 'Boooooo', '2004-08-02 01:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(836168, 95027, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the ''water'' and background color, it''s very funky and stands out. The creature is very cute, good color, no light reflections, and is nicely sharp. The light flare just above his/her head almost looks like thought bubbles. Composition is good too. I like it, it''s cute and quirky.</td>', 'I like the ''water'' and background color, it''s very funky and stands out. The creature is very cute, good color, no light reflections, and is nicely sharp. The light flare just above his/her head almost looks like thought bubbles. Composition is good too. I like it, it''s cute and quirky.', '2004-08-02 01:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(836169, 95116, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.   The angle makes me feel like I''m in the picture, which is cool.  The colors are crisp and clear and it''s a nice uncluttered composition.   You could do it again for the next challenge! (feet)</td>', 'I really like this shot.   The angle makes me feel like I''m in the picture, which is cool.  The colors are crisp and clear and it''s a nice uncluttered composition.   You could do it again for the next challenge! (feet)', '2004-08-02 01:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(836172, 95001, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow ! Such good detail.</td>', 'Wow ! Such good detail.', '2004-08-02 01:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(836173, 95216, 22656, '<td valign="top">Suductive</td>', 'Suductive', '2004-08-02 01:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(836178, 94643, 6008, '<td valign="top">The moon looks a little overexposed but I like the overall artistic impression of the shot. The gradient of light from the right into the darkness on the left is good, and the silhouette of the balcony and vines gives it a romantic feel too.</td>', 'The moon looks a little overexposed but I like the overall artistic impression of the shot. The gradient of light from the right into the darkness on the left is good, and the silhouette of the balcony and vines gives it a romantic feel too.', '2004-08-02 01:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(836184, 94819, 22656, '<td valign="top">Drawes me in.</td>', 'Drawes me in.', '2004-08-02 01:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(836186, 95266, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good idea but seems a little noisy on my screen and the black bits (birds?) are a little distracting and just make the image look even more dirty. The placement of the boat is good, the gradient of color is good although it seems more purple than blue to me. Good idea but technically not quite there.</td>', 'Good idea but seems a little noisy on my screen and the black bits (birds?) are a little distracting and just make the image look even more dirty. The placement of the boat is good, the gradient of color is good although it seems more purple than blue to me. Good idea but technically not quite there.', '2004-08-02 01:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(836191, 95207, 6008, '<td valign="top">How totally unusual. I''m guessing this isnt human but I have no idea and I actually like that aspect of it. The blonde hairs contrasts nicely with the subtle blue of the eye and the relection of the eyelashes in the eye is good too. The unusual pupil makes it that more interesting. I cant wait to find out what this actually is. Very neat shot.</td>', 'How totally unusual. I''m guessing this isnt human but I have no idea and I actually like that aspect of it. The blonde hairs contrasts nicely with the subtle blue of the eye and the relection of the eyelashes in the eye is good too. The unusual pupil makes it that more interesting. I cant wait to find out what this actually is. Very neat shot.', '2004-08-02 01:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(836194, 95016, 22656, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity.</td>', 'Amazing clarity.', '2004-08-02 01:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(836197, 94894, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and composition.  Very nice subject matter, the textures work well together.</td>', 'Great clarity and composition.  Very nice subject matter, the textures work well together.', '2004-08-02 01:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(836199, 95002, 21058, '<td valign="top">for me.. this picture fit more in the past challenge purple than in the blue one...but focus and details of the flowers is amazing!</td>', 'for me.. this picture fit more in the past challenge purple than in the blue one...but focus and details of the flowers is amazing!', '2004-08-02 01:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(836201, 95336, 24925, '<td valign="top">There''s something simply beautifully simple about this...</td>', 'There''s something simply beautifully simple about this...', '2004-08-02 01:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(836204, 95278, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s that sphere again! This does look very futuristic and has its own fisheye effect too. The skyline reflection is good and of course the blue skies and nice fluffy clouds are too. The people make it a little snapshotty but not necessarily in a bad way. The reflection of the people looks neat.</td>', 'It''s that sphere again! This does look very futuristic and has its own fisheye effect too. The skyline reflection is good and of course the blue skies and nice fluffy clouds are too. The people make it a little snapshotty but not necessarily in a bad way. The reflection of the people looks neat.', '2004-08-02 01:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(836207, 94626, 17837, '<td valign="top">looks purple to me. Will give the benefit of the doubt however cause im feeling nice today.</td>', 'looks purple to me. Will give the benefit of the doubt however cause im feeling nice today.', '2004-08-02 01:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(836208, 95027, 16241, '<td valign="top">so cute,  fun photo for challenge  8</td>', 'so cute,  fun photo for challenge  8', '2004-08-02 01:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(836210, 95156, 6008, '<td valign="top">I get a very disjointed feeling looking at this. The torso crop is fairly odd. I do like the curve on the left but it leads up to an armpit that isnt particularly appealing. The background is also a little distracting as it isnt a solid color. I like the color of the shirt, and the torso looks in pretty good shape, but I think a better pose would have helped a lot more.</td>', 'I get a very disjointed feeling looking at this. The torso crop is fairly odd. I do like the curve on the left but it leads up to an armpit that isnt particularly appealing. The background is also a little distracting as it isnt a solid color. I like the color of the shirt, and the torso looks in pretty good shape, but I think a better pose would have helped a lot more.', '2004-08-02 01:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(836212, 95043, 22496, '<td valign="top">sky, and booooooring</td>', 'sky, and booooooring', '2004-08-02 01:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(836215, 95330, 6008, '<td valign="top">The main problem I have with this shot is there isnt any particular focal point. It has the repeated pattern and the abstract feel but it doesnt really require much thought or time spent looking at it. There is nothing to lead the eye around the image, nor is there anything for the eye to rest on. In images like this it is usually good to change something or add an element to make it a little more interesting. That said, the color is good, lighting isnt bad, and it looks fairly sharp.</td>', 'The main problem I have with this shot is there isnt any particular focal point. It has the repeated pattern and the abstract feel but it doesnt really require much thought or time spent looking at it. There is nothing to lead the eye around the image, nor is there anything for the eye to rest on. In images like this it is usually good to change something or add an element to make it a little more interesting. That said, the color is good, lighting isnt bad, and it looks fairly sharp.', '2004-08-02 02:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(836216, 95320, 14620, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors here!  The clarity and focus of the shot are great!  My only critique is the reflection of what looks to be a window is a bit distracting.  But overall, it''s a wonderful shot.  Well Done.</td>', 'Excellent colors here!  The clarity and focus of the shot are great!  My only critique is the reflection of what looks to be a window is a bit distracting.  But overall, it''s a wonderful shot.  Well Done.', '2004-08-02 02:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(836221, 95280, 10390, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out 1/4-1/3 of the photo from the top, that would have made it a lot more simple and interesting IMO.</td>', 'I would have cropped out 1/4-1/3 of the photo from the top, that would have made it a lot more simple and interesting IMO.', '2004-08-02 02:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(836222, 94755, 8816, '<td valign="top">This photo would''ve been a great condidate for selective desaturation, especially since it''s ''advanced'' editing.  If you had desaturated everything but the cap, it would''ve been fantastic!  A great angle, you might''ve even gone from a little more downwards.  Also, it would have been better if you had got the entire cap in the picture.</td>', 'This photo would''ve been a great condidate for selective desaturation, especially since it''s ''advanced'' editing.  If you had desaturated everything but the cap, it would''ve been fantastic!  A great angle, you might''ve even gone from a little more downwards.  Also, it would have been better if you had got the entire cap in the picture.', '2004-08-02 02:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(836223, 94788, 6008, '<td valign="top">Ceramics are quite difficult to photograph because of the light. You''ve done a fairly good job keeping down the reflections and the ones still present arent that distracting. The background is blurred nicely and doesnt detract from the foreground elements. Another problem with ceramics is getting it so the image doesnt look out of focus. The edges look fairly sharp but the details are not really there and so it suffers from looking like it is OOF.</td>', 'Ceramics are quite difficult to photograph because of the light. You''ve done a fairly good job keeping down the reflections and the ones still present arent that distracting. The background is blurred nicely and doesnt detract from the foreground elements. Another problem with ceramics is getting it so the image doesnt look out of focus. The edges look fairly sharp but the details are not really there and so it suffers from looking like it is OOF.', '2004-08-02 02:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(836224, 95330, 10390, '<td valign="top">You should have put one different berry in there somewhere, this photo lacks some point for the eye to stop for.</td>', 'You should have put one different berry in there somewhere, this photo lacks some point for the eye to stop for.', '2004-08-02 02:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(836226, 94816, 24925, '<td valign="top">That just doesn''t do it for me...the bowl looks really nice but the berries are mostly out of focus and sour cream looks kind of nasty on there.</td>', 'That just doesn''t do it for me...the bowl looks really nice but the berries are mostly out of focus and sour cream looks kind of nasty on there.', '2004-08-02 02:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(836227, 94711, 13384, '<td valign="top">like the subject and the background is good too, but the focus and DOF to cover the bird is poor...</td>', 'like the subject and the background is good too, but the focus and DOF to cover the bird is poor...', '2004-08-02 02:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(836228, 95275, 6008, '<td valign="top">The centered composition works for this image and I like the subtle color of the blue. Exposure looks good too. Doesnt really have the ''wow'' to it but it''s a good shot.</td>', 'The centered composition works for this image and I like the subtle color of the blue. Exposure looks good too. Doesnt really have the ''wow'' to it but it''s a good shot.', '2004-08-02 02:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(836234, 94816, 10390, '<td valign="top">The focuspoint should have been more on the foreground, on the berries and the cream nearest to the camera with the bowl in the background out of focus, in that way this photo would have been much better IMHO.</td>', 'The focuspoint should have been more on the foreground, on the berries and the cream nearest to the camera with the bowl in the background out of focus, in that way this photo would have been much better IMHO.', '2004-08-02 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(836249, 95222, 22659, '<td valign="top">Super picture! I love that colour blue. The blue shadow sets it off.  - 10</td>', 'Super picture! I love that colour blue. The blue shadow sets it off.  - 10', '2004-08-02 02:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(836252, 95012, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition and natural framing is good as is the layers of the grass and the mountain between the rocks. The light looks a little harsh and even but the color is good and complimentary to the blue sky.</td>', 'Composition and natural framing is good as is the layers of the grass and the mountain between the rocks. The light looks a little harsh and even but the color is good and complimentary to the blue sky.', '2004-08-02 02:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(836253, 94533, 24925, '<td valign="top">This seems a little too melodramatic for me, but I''m assuming it has personal sentiment?<br/> <br/>The photograph seems to send conflicting messages...one of mourning and melancholy, the other of a happy, bright blue pen.  Neat idea, though.</td>', 'This seems a little too melodramatic for me, but I''m assuming it has personal sentiment? The photograph seems to send conflicting messages...one of mourning and melancholy, the other of a happy, bright blue pen.  Neat idea, though.', '2004-08-02 02:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
