(836343, 95274, 6008, '<td valign="top">The background looks like it could probably do with being a little brighter but the light on the ring isnt bad. The light reflection on the left is a little distracting but the streak on the right seems fine. The colors are fairly muted and lack impact - jewelry photography is usually very bright and flashy.</td>', 'The background looks like it could probably do with being a little brighter but the light on the ring isnt bad. The light reflection on the left is a little distracting but the streak on the right seems fine. The colors are fairly muted and lack impact - jewelry photography is usually very bright and flashy.', '2004-08-02 02:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(836345, 95137, 6008, '<td valign="top">The texture and color of the jeans is good and the golden button compliments it well. The composition is simple but effective. Good shot.</td>', 'The texture and color of the jeans is good and the golden button compliments it well. The composition is simple but effective. Good shot.', '2004-08-02 02:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
