(836354, 94683, 24925, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible picture...I hope everyone who''s voted on this doesn''t just gloss it over.  Very powerful!  First 9 I''ve given in the blue category goes to you!<br/> <br/>Even the irritating haziness which gets in the way of the in-focus flower adds incredible depth to this picture''s meaning. beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!<br/></td>', 'This is an incredible picture...I hope everyone who''s voted on this doesn''t just gloss it over.  Very powerful!  First 9 I''ve given in the blue category goes to you! Even the irritating haziness which gets in the way of the in-focus flower adds incredible depth to this picture''s meaning. beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!', '2004-08-02 02:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(836355, 94775, 24494, '<td valign="top">wheres the blue?</td>', 'wheres the blue?', '2004-08-02 02:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(836358, 94972, 6008, '<td valign="top">Because you exposed for the trees the moon is overexposed and is basically a white blob in the sky that doesnt really add that much to the image. The heron is also so far distant that it looks like a white blur. The horizon looks slightly tilted too, although the darker gradient on the right doesnt make it look so obvious. The areas that are lit on the left look quite blurry too. For night shots like this it is quite important to use a tripod. The elements are there and to some degree the composition is good, but it lacks a lot technically.</td>', 'Because you exposed for the trees the moon is overexposed and is basically a white blob in the sky that doesnt really add that much to the image. The heron is also so far distant that it looks like a white blur. The horizon looks slightly tilted too, although the darker gradient on the right doesnt make it look so obvious. The areas that are lit on the left look quite blurry too. For night shots like this it is quite important to use a tripod. The elements are there and to some degree the composition is good, but it lacks a lot technically.', '2004-08-02 02:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(836365, 94782, 24925, '<td valign="top">I have to pee when I look at this...I mean that in a good way.  Very vivid.</td>', 'I have to pee when I look at this...I mean that in a good way.  Very vivid.', '2004-08-02 02:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(836369, 95024, 22385, '<td valign="top">The moon is about to pop out of my monitor - it''s actually in 3D.  I don''t know if you intended for this or not.  I don''t think this is a ribbon winner, but I do think it is in the top 20%.  Not for its originality, but for its beauty.  Unfortunately, I''m getting a headache from looking at the moon in this photo...</td>', 'The moon is about to pop out of my monitor - it''s actually in 3D.  I don''t know if you intended for this or not.  I don''t think this is a ribbon winner, but I do think it is in the top 20%.  Not for its originality, but for its beauty.  Unfortunately, I''m getting a headache from looking at the moon in this photo...', '2004-08-02 02:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(836372, 95255, 6008, '<td valign="top">I guess there had to be a shot of the moon in here somewhere! Slightly bluish, a little soft, but good exposure and composition.</td>', 'I guess there had to be a shot of the moon in here somewhere! Slightly bluish, a little soft, but good exposure and composition.', '2004-08-02 02:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
