(836521, 94837, 5354, '<td valign="top">Statue exposure is nice, composition... not too sure I like the centred focal point. Absolutely sure I don''t like the vignette treatment.</td>', 'Statue exposure is nice, composition... not too sure I like the centred focal point. Absolutely sure I don''t like the vignette treatment.', '2004-08-02 04:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(836523, 94668, 5354, '<td valign="top">I feel the image suffers because the left hand side is so bright in relation to the right hand side. My eye is held in the brighter part of the image, but I''m sure you wanted me to really get a good look at the glass and its contents.<br/> <br/>I think you need to work on the lightin for this one</td>', 'I feel the image suffers because the left hand side is so bright in relation to the right hand side. My eye is held in the brighter part of the image, but I''m sure you wanted me to really get a good look at the glass and its contents. I think you need to work on the lightin for this one', '2004-08-02 04:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(836524, 94887, 5354, '<td valign="top">Need to fix the horizon line, theres nothing more annoying than a slanting horizon.</td>', 'Need to fix the horizon line, theres nothing more annoying than a slanting horizon.', '2004-08-02 04:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(836525, 94940, 5354, '<td valign="top">strange sort of ''lean'' on this</td>', 'strange sort of ''lean'' on this', '2004-08-02 04:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(836526, 95081, 5354, '<td valign="top">Very nice try, theres just something strange about the top of the glass. its sort of mishapen. Possibly due to the lens and the glass being off centre. It just spoils what is a great photo for me.</td>', 'Very nice try, theres just something strange about the top of the glass. its sort of mishapen. Possibly due to the lens and the glass being off centre. It just spoils what is a great photo for me.', '2004-08-02 04:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
