(836528, 95217, 5354, '<td valign="top">Really needs a lot of work. Theres a huge amount of noise in the picture, its not in focus, theres a strange wite edge of a vase poking into the image, which needs to be either in or out. The composition is attrocious. Where''s the blue connection ?<br/> <br/>Sorry but I can''t give it any more than a 2</td>', 'Really needs a lot of work. Theres a huge amount of noise in the picture, its not in focus, theres a strange wite edge of a vase poking into the image, which needs to be either in or out. The composition is attrocious. Where''s the blue connection ? Sorry but I can''t give it any more than a 2', '2004-08-02 04:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(836529, 95159, 5354, '<td valign="top">The definition has been lost on this, foe a macro to work you have to have the detail pin sharpe, this one just hasn''t got that.</td>', 'The definition has been lost on this, foe a macro to work you have to have the detail pin sharpe, this one just hasn''t got that.', '2004-08-02 04:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(836530, 94754, 5354, '<td valign="top">The lighting really lets this down. Theres an opportunity to have some real impact with this image, but its just dull. It needs sparkle, and zap.</td>', 'The lighting really lets this down. Theres an opportunity to have some real impact with this image, but its just dull. It needs sparkle, and zap.', '2004-08-02 04:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(836534, 95154, 5354, '<td valign="top">The eye is good, but the work you have done around the edge really spoils this image. Sorry</td>', 'The eye is good, but the work you have done around the edge really spoils this image. Sorry', '2004-08-02 04:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(836535, 95027, 10268, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this and I''m not sure why.  The water looks awesome, especially with the purple cast over it.  Anyway, great focus, cool subject, and weirdly awesome.  9.</td>', 'I really, really like this and I''m not sure why.  The water looks awesome, especially with the purple cast over it.  Anyway, great focus, cool subject, and weirdly awesome.  9.', '2004-08-02 04:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
