(836546, 95127, 10268, '<td valign="top">Looks a little bit too saturated.  And there is some blue on the trees that  think couldn''t have been removed.  Composition is great.  Focus is good.  6.</td>', 'Looks a little bit too saturated.  And there is some blue on the trees that  think couldn''t have been removed.  Composition is great.  Focus is good.  6.', '2004-08-02 04:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
