(836910, 95000, 14603, '<td valign="top">Someone taking the bravery test....select desat and high key in one pic  :)<br/>I love both techniques and this is a great example of how well it can work.<br/>Blending the skin tones into the background ..making the subject appear to emerge from the light is something I really like to see. The blue tones in the eye just help to add impact to the overall package. Great composition into the bargain.<br/>I really hope this does well as it deserves to....10</td>', 'Someone taking the bravery test....select desat and high key in one pic  :)I love both techniques and this is a great example of how well it can work.Blending the skin tones into the background ..making the subject appear to emerge from the light is something I really like to see. The blue tones in the eye just help to add impact to the overall package. Great composition into the bargain.I really hope this does well as it deserves to....10', '2004-08-02 10:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
