(837730, 95025, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good stock image(that is a complement). I like the choice of dof. It forces the focus to the blueberries. Maybe give just a tad more to get some good contrast on the beater. The prop arrangement is good. The only things that could be improved is the color. It seems to be muddy. You can adjust that post processing. I don''t know which program you have. I use psp and I would do a manual color correction using the upper left corner as the area to shift. I would choose a neutral light grey for the color. Then do a histogram adjustment for more contrast.</td>', 'Good stock image(that is a complement). I like the choice of dof. It forces the focus to the blueberries. Maybe give just a tad more to get some good contrast on the beater. The prop arrangement is good. The only things that could be improved is the color. It seems to be muddy. You can adjust that post processing. I don''t know which program you have. I use psp and I would do a manual color correction using the upper left corner as the area to shift. I would choose a neutral light grey for the color. Then do a histogram adjustment for more contrast.', '2004-08-02 18:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(837732, 94888, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract</td>', 'Nice abstract', '2004-08-02 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(837742, 95116, 24846, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective. Nice blue. Be a good feet challenge too.</td>', 'I like the perspective. Nice blue. Be a good feet challenge too.', '2004-08-02 18:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(837752, 94929, 22922, '<td valign="top">I would desaturate all the channels but blue (possibly leave a bit of cyan to catch the variation in his eyes).  That would make this less of a "kid" photo. His nose looks very orange, kind of distracting.  Great capture, just needs some tweaking.</td>', 'I would desaturate all the channels but blue (possibly leave a bit of cyan to catch the variation in his eyes).  That would make this less of a "kid" photo. His nose looks very orange, kind of distracting.  Great capture, just needs some tweaking.', '2004-08-02 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
