(837762, 95064, 20941, '<td valign="top">there is alot of blue here, so meets the challenge in that respect. I would suggest using a more attractive backround at least, and if the cup handle had been tuned sideways you probably would have a better focus on that.</td>', 'there is alot of blue here, so meets the challenge in that respect. I would suggest using a more attractive backround at least, and if the cup handle had been tuned sideways you probably would have a better focus on that.', '2004-08-02 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
