(837771, 94613, 22922, '<td valign="top">Too much glare in the eye, the white spot throws off the look of the image.  Nice color otherwise.</td>', 'Too much glare in the eye, the white spot throws off the look of the image.  Nice color otherwise.', '2004-08-02 18:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(837772, 94940, 24846, '<td valign="top">Neat. How did you do that? Maybe soften the glare, but maybe not? Nice shot.</td>', 'Neat. How did you do that? Maybe soften the glare, but maybe not? Nice shot.', '2004-08-02 18:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(837775, 95159, 11800, '<td valign="top">If the feather was floating maybe softness would be ok. Or if it was closer and some details were evident it would be ok. In this picture it looks as if the softness was an error in focus. There is a difference that can be seen between soft focus and a picture that is oof. With soft focus, the picture will still show the areas of sharpest focus as sharp while the areas with less focus will have a glow.  An inaccurately focused shot will not have any area of shapness.</td>', 'If the feather was floating maybe softness would be ok. Or if it was closer and some details were evident it would be ok. In this picture it looks as if the softness was an error in focus. There is a difference that can be seen between soft focus and a picture that is oof. With soft focus, the picture will still show the areas of sharpest focus as sharp while the areas with less focus will have a glow.  An inaccurately focused shot will not have any area of shapness.', '2004-08-02 18:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(837778, 95056, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I am very new at photography and would like to know how you did this.  I will look forward to seeing your comments after the challenge.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I am very new at photography and would like to know how you did this.  I will look forward to seeing your comments after the challenge.', '2004-08-02 18:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(837780, 95079, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Like the title and symbolism.</td>', 'Nice shot. Like the title and symbolism.', '2004-08-02 18:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(837782, 95116, 22922, '<td valign="top">This would work better without the jeans.  They make her legs look crooked, and throw off the idea of the image.  Just the legs with the slippers, and you have a great image.</td>', 'This would work better without the jeans.  They make her legs look crooked, and throw off the idea of the image.  Just the legs with the slippers, and you have a great image.', '2004-08-02 18:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(837783, 94937, 20941, '<td valign="top">although the backround is blue, the incense and holder which should be your main subject, appear quite purple on my monitor. Nice colors though.</td>', 'although the backround is blue, the incense and holder which should be your main subject, appear quite purple on my monitor. Nice colors though.', '2004-08-02 18:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(837801, 95093, 22922, '<td valign="top">The hat washes out his eyes, I can hardly tell they''re blue.  I like the hat, though, so maybe desat the eyes and leave just the hat blue.  Nicely done portrait.</td>', 'The hat washes out his eyes, I can hardly tell they''re blue.  I like the hat, though, so maybe desat the eyes and leave just the hat blue.  Nicely done portrait.', '2004-08-02 18:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
