(837822, 94704, 22922, '<td valign="top">Please use Photoshop or your photo editing program to make the photo 640 pixels on the long edge, then optimize for the web at 150k.  Tiny pictures are hard for us to judge, and you will get alot of 1s from people who don''t bother with small photos.  It looks a bit blurry to me, use a faster shutter speed since you''re in bright sun.</td>', 'Please use Photoshop or your photo editing program to make the photo 640 pixels on the long edge, then optimize for the web at 150k.  Tiny pictures are hard for us to judge, and you will get alot of 1s from people who don''t bother with small photos.  It looks a bit blurry to me, use a faster shutter speed since you''re in bright sun.', '2004-08-02 18:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(837826, 95216, 22922, '<td valign="top">The coloring on the lips is uneven, not sure if it''s the variation of the skin or not, but it looks unfinished.  Interesting idea, her face is a little washed out.</td>', 'The coloring on the lips is uneven, not sure if it''s the variation of the skin or not, but it looks unfinished.  Interesting idea, her face is a little washed out.', '2004-08-02 18:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
