(838460, 94643, 16301, '<td valign="top">I really like this, I just don''t know why! Maybe because its mysterious? I love the motion of the clouds and that plant in the frame.<br/> <br/>(9) Good luck...</td>', 'I really like this, I just don''t know why! Maybe because its mysterious? I love the motion of the clouds and that plant in the frame. (9) Good luck...', '2004-08-03 00:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
