(838495, 94819, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.  I might have liked more if the doors were less centered, but the objects on either side are complementary nonetheless.  The colours are fantastic - 9</td>', 'Lovely photo.  I might have liked more if the doors were less centered, but the objects on either side are complementary nonetheless.  The colours are fantastic - 9', '2004-08-03 00:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(838497, 95110, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool image. It''s a little grainy (especially the bacjground) and almost too dark to tell that it''s a marble. I love how the light comes through the marble though! I can see the light beams on the near side of it. Very nice. Just too bad the graininess and lack of detail hurt the image so badly. This could otherwise be a definite ribbon winner.</td>', 'Cool image. It''s a little grainy (especially the bacjground) and almost too dark to tell that it''s a marble. I love how the light comes through the marble though! I can see the light beams on the near side of it. Very nice. Just too bad the graininess and lack of detail hurt the image so badly. This could otherwise be a definite ribbon winner.', '2004-08-03 00:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(838511, 95221, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours - vivid, but somehow soothing.  My only criticism would be that there''s some dust or lint of some sort on the nearest candle, which is distracting, but that''s very minor and difficult to avoid.  Very nice, I hope this does well.</td>', 'Lovely colours - vivid, but somehow soothing.  My only criticism would be that there''s some dust or lint of some sort on the nearest candle, which is distracting, but that''s very minor and difficult to avoid.  Very nice, I hope this does well.', '2004-08-03 01:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(838513, 94599, 16790, '<td valign="top">The border''s a tad harsh, but the photo itself is lovely.  Nice job.</td>', 'The border''s a tad harsh, but the photo itself is lovely.  Nice job.', '2004-08-03 01:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(838519, 94675, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Excellent colours, and the reflections are minimal.  This one has a definite sense of balance about it.  I see some compression artifacts in the background; that''s my only complaint.  One of my favourites so far - 10</td>', 'Lovely!  Excellent colours, and the reflections are minimal.  This one has a definite sense of balance about it.  I see some compression artifacts in the background; that''s my only complaint.  One of my favourites so far - 10', '2004-08-03 01:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(838521, 94572, 16790, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it was intentional or not, but this seems to be quite out of focus.  Otherwise, the composition is very nice, and the harsh contrast works well.</td>', 'Not sure if it was intentional or not, but this seems to be quite out of focus.  Otherwise, the composition is very nice, and the harsh contrast works well.', '2004-08-03 01:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(838525, 95127, 16790, '<td valign="top">I really like the little girl sitting on the bench; I think the selective desaturation would''ve been much more effective had the blues of her dress been the only ones left intact.  Of course, it would''ve had to be done manually, but I think the effect would''ve been much better.  As it is, the playground seems to draw the viewer''s eye much more than the girl, and she is the more deserving subject.  Maybe try airbrushing the rest out in Colour mode with some black or white, just to see.  At any rate, the photo itself is nicely composed.</td>', 'I really like the little girl sitting on the bench; I think the selective desaturation would''ve been much more effective had the blues of her dress been the only ones left intact.  Of course, it would''ve had to be done manually, but I think the effect would''ve been much better.  As it is, the playground seems to draw the viewer''s eye much more than the girl, and she is the more deserving subject.  Maybe try airbrushing the rest out in Colour mode with some black or white, just to see.  At any rate, the photo itself is nicely composed.', '2004-08-03 01:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
