(839703, 94665, 22748, '<td valign="top">Ah, finally some blue again, the last 3 images I voted on were pictures of the moon, without blue! Argh. Glad someone read the challenge description!!<br/> <br/>I don''t understand the title, I guess it''s something technical. There are some beautiful deep blue gems, and some funky little ceramic-like balls.  I like the DOF and focus. The group of balls in the distance feel like an audience watching the closer part of the scene. I might prefer having the in-focus area, the main subject of the scene, be brighter though, and keep the brightest areas away from the edges like the top edge seems to have right now. I like the composition and how you''ve cropped tightly.</td>', 'Ah, finally some blue again, the last 3 images I voted on were pictures of the moon, without blue! Argh. Glad someone read the challenge description!! I don''t understand the title, I guess it''s something technical. There are some beautiful deep blue gems, and some funky little ceramic-like balls.  I like the DOF and focus. The group of balls in the distance feel like an audience watching the closer part of the scene. I might prefer having the in-focus area, the main subject of the scene, be brighter though, and keep the brightest areas away from the edges like the top edge seems to have right now. I like the composition and how you''ve cropped tightly.', '2004-08-03 15:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
