(839751, 94741, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good bird shot. Nice rich blue. Too bad the focus is on the belly of the bird, it would have been nice to have the eye be the point of focus. A little more DOF might have been needed too to get the blue feathers sharp as well. I like the yellow (green? I don''t see greens well... :) and how it works with the blue.</td>', 'Good bird shot. Nice rich blue. Too bad the focus is on the belly of the bird, it would have been nice to have the eye be the point of focus. A little more DOF might have been needed too to get the blue feathers sharp as well. I like the yellow (green? I don''t see greens well... :) and how it works with the blue.', '2004-08-03 16:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(839754, 95017, 22748, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, the execution could be improved, though. It seems to have been taken with the on-camera flash, which makes everything very flat and washed out. The skin feels pale and sickly because of the flash. Also, the image is a big grainy. With natural light, the blue color would be more vivid and the skin would appear more beautiful and smooth.</td>', 'The idea is good, the execution could be improved, though. It seems to have been taken with the on-camera flash, which makes everything very flat and washed out. The skin feels pale and sickly because of the flash. Also, the image is a big grainy. With natural light, the blue color would be more vivid and the skin would appear more beautiful and smooth.', '2004-08-03 16:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(839756, 95165, 16241, '<td valign="top">gorgeous...........  gotta be top 3</td>', 'gorgeous...........  gotta be top 3', '2004-08-03 16:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(839759, 94972, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool, I like how the trees are blurred. This really looks like a painting! It''s very neat. The horizon is a bit out of whack though, it''s skewed to one side.</td>', 'Cool, I like how the trees are blurred. This really looks like a painting! It''s very neat. The horizon is a bit out of whack though, it''s skewed to one side.', '2004-08-03 16:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
