(839766, 95064, 22748, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a little harsh. Did you use the built-in flash on the camera? Also, in compositions like this, I find that getting lower helps a lot, right down on the ground on your belly, even. 8-) I like the variety of blue shades here though, with better lighting this could be very nice.</td>', 'Lighting''s a little harsh. Did you use the built-in flash on the camera? Also, in compositions like this, I find that getting lower helps a lot, right down on the ground on your belly, even. 8-) I like the variety of blue shades here though, with better lighting this could be very nice.', '2004-08-03 16:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
