(839770, 95258, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh! Gorgeous picture. The blue is so pure and smooth. Great composition, exposure, and colors. Really beautiful.</td>', 'Oooh! Gorgeous picture. The blue is so pure and smooth. Great composition, exposure, and colors. Really beautiful.', '2004-08-03 16:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(839772, 95184, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. The blue is a very nice deep blue color. It''s very blurry, though, feels like camera shake. Try a tripod, or increasing the lighting. Also try to use most of the 150KB you have available for your image submission! You only used 40KB of that, which caused a lot of JPEG artifacts in the background. When you "Save for Web", increase the quality setting to get around 140KB.</td>', 'Cool picture. The blue is a very nice deep blue color. It''s very blurry, though, feels like camera shake. Try a tripod, or increasing the lighting. Also try to use most of the 150KB you have available for your image submission! You only used 40KB of that, which caused a lot of JPEG artifacts in the background. When you "Save for Web", increase the quality setting to get around 140KB.', '2004-08-03 16:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(839774, 94816, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the bowl color and how it works with the blueberries. It would be nice to have a deeper DOF so at least the closer berries were sharp, though, and a little more light on the berries.</td>', 'I like the bowl color and how it works with the blueberries. It would be nice to have a deeper DOF so at least the closer berries were sharp, though, and a little more light on the berries.', '2004-08-03 16:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(839775, 94711, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors. Focus is close, but it would be better if the eyes were in sharp focus, that always makes the human brain think the image is sharper than it otherwise would see it. I like the hot/cold color contrast between the blue and red/yellows.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors. Focus is close, but it would be better if the eyes were in sharp focus, that always makes the human brain think the image is sharper than it otherwise would see it. I like the hot/cold color contrast between the blue and red/yellows.', '2004-08-03 16:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(839778, 94929, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I reall like the placement of the eyes and how the space was left for them to look into. Nice reflections in the eyes. Slightly grainy though, but great sharp focus on the close eye and I like the DOF.</td>', 'Great composition. I reall like the placement of the eyes and how the space was left for them to look into. Nice reflections in the eyes. Slightly grainy though, but great sharp focus on the close eye and I like the DOF.', '2004-08-03 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(839780, 94942, 22748, '<td valign="top">Incredible image. This is one of the best in the challenge. Nice background!! It really makes this image great, the hot/cold colors work so well together here. The lighting is great and the exposure is perfect. I think a 10 is in order here!</td>', 'Incredible image. This is one of the best in the challenge. Nice background!! It really makes this image great, the hot/cold colors work so well together here. The lighting is great and the exposure is perfect. I think a 10 is in order here!', '2004-08-03 16:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
