(839783, 95268, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, nice idea. It''s pretty sharp and well exposed. Maybe an angle other than straight on would improve the interestingness of the composition, though.</td>', 'Cool picture, nice idea. It''s pretty sharp and well exposed. Maybe an angle other than straight on would improve the interestingness of the composition, though.', '2004-08-03 16:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(839785, 94766, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space here. The sky is so smooth and rich in color, and I love the gradient from deep blue on the upper right to lighter blue in the lower left.</td>', 'I like the use of negative space here. The sky is so smooth and rich in color, and I love the gradient from deep blue on the upper right to lighter blue in the lower left.', '2004-08-03 16:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
