(839791, 95116, 22748, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.. beautiful feet...  Oh, yeah, it''s the blue I should be looking for... The threefold blue, jeans, flip-flops, and sky really make a cool composition. The frame is well filled leaving out any wasted space or distracting elements. Nice sharp focus and great color definition.</td>', 'Mmmm.. beautiful feet...  Oh, yeah, it''s the blue I should be looking for... The threefold blue, jeans, flip-flops, and sky really make a cool composition. The frame is well filled leaving out any wasted space or distracting elements. Nice sharp focus and great color definition.', '2004-08-03 16:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
