(840259, 94815, 20066, '<td valign="top">The best fireworks photo I''ve seen in this challenge.  But fireworks photos are difficult to do and the other I''ve seen aren''t so good.</td>', 'The best fireworks photo I''ve seen in this challenge.  But fireworks photos are difficult to do and the other I''ve seen aren''t so good.', '2004-08-03 20:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
