(840346, 95131, 22748, '<td valign="top">Ooooo... big yuck factor here. Unique image. Nice reflection in the water. Gotta put yourself in the dangerous spots to get the interesting photos, eh?</td>', 'Ooooo... big yuck factor here. Unique image. Nice reflection in the water. Gotta put yourself in the dangerous spots to get the interesting photos, eh?', '2004-08-03 21:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(840347, 94796, 22748, '<td valign="top">Dude... what a sweet ride. Technically well done photograph. Other angles might provide a more interesting view as well (I like to get down real low, on the ground, or some other radical angle).</td>', 'Dude... what a sweet ride. Technically well done photograph. Other angles might provide a more interesting view as well (I like to get down real low, on the ground, or some other radical angle).', '2004-08-03 21:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(840348, 95046, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool!. A little grainy, not too bad though. Interesting lighting on the dimples (or pimples rather? dimples are depressions in the skin...) makes the pattern more interesting and makes nice shadows.</td>', 'Cool!. A little grainy, not too bad though. Interesting lighting on the dimples (or pimples rather? dimples are depressions in the skin...) makes the pattern more interesting and makes nice shadows.', '2004-08-03 21:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(840349, 95137, 22748, '<td valign="top">The best jeans picture by far. Great lighting and color. Excellent sharpness. Nice slightly shallow DOF but sharp focus on the button that feels like it should be the center of attention.</td>', 'The best jeans picture by far. Great lighting and color. Excellent sharpness. Nice slightly shallow DOF but sharp focus on the button that feels like it should be the center of attention.', '2004-08-03 21:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(840351, 95005, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is really cool. I love the smooth texture to it, both the large blue area and the neon-like rectangle.</td>', 'Wow. This is really cool. I love the smooth texture to it, both the large blue area and the neon-like rectangle.', '2004-08-03 21:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(840352, 95035, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice sky. Clouds make it interesting. Interesting sillhouttes by the landscape too.</td>', 'Nice sky. Clouds make it interesting. Interesting sillhouttes by the landscape too.', '2004-08-03 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(840355, 94950, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous work. This is good stuff. Great lighting, composition, processing. The image is neat and clean, the background is bright; there is however a little blue tint at the upper right corner of the background particularly, that is my main complaint however. Also it might be nice to see the rest of the shadow on the left side where it''s cut off, perhaps.</td>', 'Fabulous work. This is good stuff. Great lighting, composition, processing. The image is neat and clean, the background is bright; there is however a little blue tint at the upper right corner of the background particularly, that is my main complaint however. Also it might be nice to see the rest of the shadow on the left side where it''s cut off, perhaps.', '2004-08-03 21:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(840357, 94721, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, nice title. Definitely blue.</td>', 'Nice pic, nice title. Definitely blue.', '2004-08-03 21:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(840359, 95334, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice sky pic, nice vignetting. Feels like I''m in a trance and my vision is locked in tunnel vision, all I can see is sky. And BLUE. 8-)</td>', 'Nice sky pic, nice vignetting. Feels like I''m in a trance and my vision is locked in tunnel vision, all I can see is sky. And BLUE. 8-)', '2004-08-03 21:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(840361, 94703, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. a little blurry. pretty nice colors.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. a little blurry. pretty nice colors.', '2004-08-03 21:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(840363, 94623, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Cool reflection. Slightly grainy and pixellated, maybe you used a digital zoom? Good choice of subject though and the mirror seems to be a good way to eliminate shadows... I''ll have to remember that.</td>', 'Nice macro. Cool reflection. Slightly grainy and pixellated, maybe you used a digital zoom? Good choice of subject though and the mirror seems to be a good way to eliminate shadows... I''ll have to remember that.', '2004-08-03 21:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(840365, 95331, 22748, '<td valign="top">Title''s okay. Picture''s technically fine but I would think another angle might provide a more visually interesting picture. This is just kind of centered which sometimes doesn''t give the eye anywhere to go.</td>', 'Title''s okay. Picture''s technically fine but I would think another angle might provide a more visually interesting picture. This is just kind of centered which sometimes doesn''t give the eye anywhere to go.', '2004-08-03 21:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(840366, 95010, 22748, '<td valign="top">Whoa, is that real? Pretty freaky. Good shot. The closest pincer is a bit OOF, it looks like the focal point was in the background, maybe you let the camera do autofocus using the center zone. So the DOF appears plenty deep, the focus just needs to be a little closer so the whole critter is crisp.</td>', 'Whoa, is that real? Pretty freaky. Good shot. The closest pincer is a bit OOF, it looks like the focal point was in the background, maybe you let the camera do autofocus using the center zone. So the DOF appears plenty deep, the focus just needs to be a little closer so the whole critter is crisp.', '2004-08-03 21:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(840368, 95274, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. A little brighter background might be better but this is still a nice crisp picture.</td>', 'Nice macro. A little brighter background might be better but this is still a nice crisp picture.', '2004-08-03 21:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(840378, 95025, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice still-life. The composition is great. A deeper DOF might be nice so all the blueberries could be sharp, but maybe the background would be sharper than you want. I like this one.</td>', 'Nice still-life. The composition is great. A deeper DOF might be nice so all the blueberries could be sharp, but maybe the background would be sharper than you want. I like this one.', '2004-08-03 21:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(840384, 94894, 22748, '<td valign="top">Is this a marble pic and a jeans pic all in one?! Good marble shot. Better than the last one I saw. This is nice and sharp on the subject. Good title, I like how we can see the nicks in the marble.</td>', 'Is this a marble pic and a jeans pic all in one?! Good marble shot. Better than the last one I saw. This is nice and sharp on the subject. Good title, I like how we can see the nicks in the marble.', '2004-08-03 21:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(840386, 94574, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good colors, nice clean, crisp image.</td>', 'Good colors, nice clean, crisp image.', '2004-08-03 21:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(840396, 94813, 22748, '<td valign="top">I was thinking about using a blued gun in a shot too! Nice work here. Good alignment of the elements, good choice of background, it works nicely. A little more light might help, back by the grip it''s a little dark. I like how the six cartridges represent the six-shooter. <br/> <br/>I wonder if a lot of people won''t understand "Blue Steel" because they might not know what blued steel is... you might get a lot of "there''s no blue in it" comments.</td>', 'I was thinking about using a blued gun in a shot too! Nice work here. Good alignment of the elements, good choice of background, it works nicely. A little more light might help, back by the grip it''s a little dark. I like how the six cartridges represent the six-shooter.  I wonder if a lot of people won''t understand "Blue Steel" because they might not know what blued steel is... you might get a lot of "there''s no blue in it" comments.', '2004-08-03 21:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
