(840520, 94772, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. A little more light on the model''s face would be nice but it''s still good.</td>', 'Nice portrait. A little more light on the model''s face would be nice but it''s still good.', '2004-08-03 23:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(840521, 95122, 22748, '<td valign="top">It''s a little bit blurry and grainy, but interesting abstract patterns and colors.</td>', 'It''s a little bit blurry and grainy, but interesting abstract patterns and colors.', '2004-08-03 23:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(840522, 94809, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It''s a camo-plane! Using sky-cloud camo. Should have used the plain old blue-sky camo pattern this clear day, the enemy will see that white spot... <br/> <br/>Nice bright colors and clear image.</td>', 'Nice capture. It''s a camo-plane! Using sky-cloud camo. Should have used the plain old blue-sky camo pattern this clear day, the enemy will see that white spot...  Nice bright colors and clear image.', '2004-08-03 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(840524, 94940, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. I like the refracted light''s patterns on the wall and the three fine streams of liquid coming down.</td>', 'Cool photo. I like the refracted light''s patterns on the wall and the three fine streams of liquid coming down.', '2004-08-03 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(840536, 94878, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. The lighting and exposure are spot on. But it feels a tiny bit unsharp in the model''s hair, face and hands particularly. <br/> <br/>Something is up with the shadows underneath the dress though. The highlights seem to indicate the main light is to the right slightly, but the fake-looking soft shadows under the dress are strange. The dress is sitting in piles as if it were on the ground, but there is still a shadow visible undernear. Is it some weird illusion, or a bad Photoshop job of adding phony shadows? I like it a little less now that the shadows trouble me.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. The lighting and exposure are spot on. But it feels a tiny bit unsharp in the model''s hair, face and hands particularly.  Something is up with the shadows underneath the dress though. The highlights seem to indicate the main light is to the right slightly, but the fake-looking soft shadows under the dress are strange. The dress is sitting in piles as if it were on the ground, but there is still a shadow visible undernear. Is it some weird illusion, or a bad Photoshop job of adding phony shadows? I like it a little less now that the shadows trouble me.', '2004-08-03 23:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(840538, 94738, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice! The hair is neat, centering the hair really works. The image is smooth and clean. The blue is deep and rich. Great expression on the model''s face.</td>', 'Nice! The hair is neat, centering the hair really works. The image is smooth and clean. The blue is deep and rich. Great expression on the model''s face.', '2004-08-03 23:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(840551, 94684, 19672, '<td valign="top">i am feeling like i want to see more of the cheek...just a little...but definitely cool</td>', 'i am feeling like i want to see more of the cheek...just a little...but definitely cool', '2004-08-03 23:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
