(840619, 95276, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, it took me a minute to see it. It''s a little blurry though.</td>', 'Nice reflection, it took me a minute to see it. It''s a little blurry though.', '2004-08-04 00:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
