(840659, 94972, 12857, '<td valign="top">So surreal!!  I love it<br/>dc</td>', 'So surreal!!  I love itdc', '2004-08-04 00:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(840660, 94848, 24065, '<td valign="top">I would have given this higher marks if the parking lot and lights had been cropped out of photo.  opps, my mistake for not looking at the title first.  Never mind...  The moon and clouds are stunning!</td>', 'I would have given this higher marks if the parking lot and lights had been cropped out of photo.  opps, my mistake for not looking at the title first.  Never mind...  The moon and clouds are stunning!', '2004-08-04 00:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(840665, 95276, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea.  I know the baby is part of the theme, but I''d like to see how much you could get from just the reflection in the blue ball.  I think that would be interesting.</td>', 'This is a cute idea.  I know the baby is part of the theme, but I''d like to see how much you could get from just the reflection in the blue ball.  I think that would be interesting.', '2004-08-04 00:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(840667, 95000, 12857, '<td valign="top">This shot has been done many times, but I think that you made it work.   The placement of the face in the frame makes me feel like I need to know more about this man.  Good job. <br/>dc</td>', 'This shot has been done many times, but I think that you made it work.   The placement of the face in the frame makes me feel like I need to know more about this man.  Good job. dc', '2004-08-04 00:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(840670, 94880, 24065, '<td valign="top">I think more contrast would have helped -- maybe making the trees darker and the clouds lighter.  However, the blue cast to everything was probably the point of the photo and I just missed it the first time around.</td>', 'I think more contrast would have helped -- maybe making the trees darker and the clouds lighter.  However, the blue cast to everything was probably the point of the photo and I just missed it the first time around.', '2004-08-04 00:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(840675, 95266, 24065, '<td valign="top">It needs to be lightened some so the white boat will contrast with the blue expanse rather than blending into it -- at least in my opinion.  I''m also wondering if the DPC rules would allow you to clone out the marks in the center right section.  I do like the "blue expanse."</td>', 'It needs to be lightened some so the white boat will contrast with the blue expanse rather than blending into it -- at least in my opinion.  I''m also wondering if the DPC rules would allow you to clone out the marks in the center right section.  I do like the "blue expanse."', '2004-08-04 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(840677, 94823, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the photo and the mood portrayed in the person''s posture and face.  I probably would have cropped out the wires (I think that''s what they are) at the bottom right.</td>', 'I like the angle of the photo and the mood portrayed in the person''s posture and face.  I probably would have cropped out the wires (I think that''s what they are) at the bottom right.', '2004-08-04 00:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(840680, 94683, 24065, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I love the reflection in the blue, just don''t like the glaring out-of-focus flower near the front.  However, it is probably a very good depiction of manic-depression!</td>', 'Good idea.  I love the reflection in the blue, just don''t like the glaring out-of-focus flower near the front.  However, it is probably a very good depiction of manic-depression!', '2004-08-04 00:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(840684, 94717, 23934, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2004-08-04 00:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(840686, 95255, 24238, '<td valign="top">You must have a really kick ass lense.  Good  purchase.  Great moon capture-the color looks a little off for a blue challenge but still something I''d like to see on my wall.</td>', 'You must have a really kick ass lense.  Good  purchase.  Great moon capture-the color looks a little off for a blue challenge but still something I''d like to see on my wall.', '2004-08-04 00:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(840689, 94837, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the angel in the moonlight.  I wonder how she would look against a darker blue, solid background?  I''ve also read that statuary is good in B&amp;W -- altho it wouldn''t have worked well for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea of the angel in the moonlight.  I wonder how she would look against a darker blue, solid background?  I''ve also read that statuary is good in B&W -- altho it wouldn''t have worked well for this challenge.', '2004-08-04 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(840691, 94878, 23934, '<td valign="top">All I can say is Beautiful.</td>', 'All I can say is Beautiful.', '2004-08-04 00:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(840694, 95192, 24065, '<td valign="top">Too much of the main subject is out of focus for my personal taste.  I think the shot would be great if cropped closer, tho, becuase the face of the dragonfly is outstanding against the flower.</td>', 'Too much of the main subject is out of focus for my personal taste.  I think the shot would be great if cropped closer, tho, becuase the face of the dragonfly is outstanding against the flower.', '2004-08-04 00:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(840696, 94809, 24065, '<td valign="top">I''ve been reading a lot about the rule of thirds for composition.  I know you''re supposed to break the rules on some occasions, but I''m wondering if moving the plane into one of the "thirds" places would improve the interest of the photo.  It certainly meets the challenge, though.</td>', 'I''ve been reading a lot about the rule of thirds for composition.  I know you''re supposed to break the rules on some occasions, but I''m wondering if moving the plane into one of the "thirds" places would improve the interest of the photo.  It certainly meets the challenge, though.', '2004-08-04 00:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(840701, 94619, 23934, '<td valign="top">peaceful.  I like it</td>', 'peaceful.  I like it', '2004-08-04 00:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(840702, 95051, 24065, '<td valign="top">I think it might have helped if the window had been cropped out of the photo.  When I scroll down so that I don''t see it the blue composition is very pleasing and one of the more creative entries for the challenge.</td>', 'I think it might have helped if the window had been cropped out of the photo.  When I scroll down so that I don''t see it the blue composition is very pleasing and one of the more creative entries for the challenge.', '2004-08-04 00:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(840703, 94979, 24065, '<td valign="top">Perhaps closer cropping would have helped the composition.  Or selective desaturation.  The focus of the mime and balloon is incredible.  Very nice when contrasted with the out-of-focus crowd in the back.</td>', 'Perhaps closer cropping would have helped the composition.  Or selective desaturation.  The focus of the mime and balloon is incredible.  Very nice when contrasted with the out-of-focus crowd in the back.', '2004-08-04 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(840705, 95066, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the shades of blue.  I think I would have cropped it closer and done some auto-levels, contrasts and saturations in Photoshop.</td>', 'I like the shades of blue.  I think I would have cropped it closer and done some auto-levels, contrasts and saturations in Photoshop.', '2004-08-04 00:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(840707, 95334, 24065, '<td valign="top">It appears out of focus somehow.  But I love the colors and contrasts.</td>', 'It appears out of focus somehow.  But I love the colors and contrasts.', '2004-08-04 00:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(840709, 95002, 23294, '<td valign="top">not sure it''s really blue, probably coulda shifted the hue a bit to really get blue.  I like the shot and gave it a 9.</td>', 'not sure it''s really blue, probably coulda shifted the hue a bit to really get blue.  I like the shot and gave it a 9.', '2004-08-04 00:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(840710, 95059, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition.  It does appear a little dark, tho.  I don''t know enough about photography yet to give concrete suggestions.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition.  It does appear a little dark, tho.  I don''t know enough about photography yet to give concrete suggestions.', '2004-08-04 00:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(840711, 95165, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great idea....food dye? Ink? WHatever, it is well done, shot and my fav so far. Good luck! Oh....composition....hmmm....I might not have centered the glass or at least cropped in from the left a good bit... the negative space does not work for me too well....but I like it very much  all the same.</td>', 'Great idea....food dye? Ink? WHatever, it is well done, shot and my fav so far. Good luck! Oh....composition....hmmm....I might not have centered the glass or at least cropped in from the left a good bit... the negative space does not work for me too well....but I like it very much  all the same.', '2004-08-04 00:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(840714, 95149, 23294, '<td valign="top">While the title is missleading, the subject is clear and really draws attention.  9.</td>', 'While the title is missleading, the subject is clear and really draws attention.  9.', '2004-08-04 00:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(840716, 94599, 8891, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and shot, would have worked well for the balance challenge, too. Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely composition and shot, would have worked well for the balance challenge, too. Nice work.', '2004-08-04 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(840718, 95079, 24065, '<td valign="top">I completely missed the title the first time around, so came back to update my comments. and rating.  The different shades of blue in the photo are very interesting</td>', 'I completely missed the title the first time around, so came back to update my comments. and rating.  The different shades of blue in the photo are very interesting', '2004-08-04 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(840720, 94693, 23294, '<td valign="top">A photo where the subject is the only thing not blue is kinda cool.  Even tho it''s centered I do like this photo, gave it a 9.</td>', 'A photo where the subject is the only thing not blue is kinda cool.  Even tho it''s centered I do like this photo, gave it a 9.', '2004-08-04 00:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(840724, 95258, 24065, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of the Galileo thermometer (I think that''s what it is).  I can''t wait to go photograph my friend''s!</td>', 'I love the idea of the Galileo thermometer (I think that''s what it is).  I can''t wait to go photograph my friend''s!', '2004-08-04 00:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(840726, 95107, 24065, '<td valign="top">I really like the bikes, the blue cannister and the little yellow wildflowers all together in the same photo.  I would like the photo better if it had been cropped more on the top and right, cutting out all of the green &amp; white.</td>', 'I really like the bikes, the blue cannister and the little yellow wildflowers all together in the same photo.  I would like the photo better if it had been cropped more on the top and right, cutting out all of the green & white.', '2004-08-04 00:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(840727, 94799, 23294, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, just a walk with the dogs.  The backround is beautiful!  even the framing matches well being blue.  9.</td>', 'Nice idea, just a walk with the dogs.  The backround is beautiful!  even the framing matches well being blue.  9.', '2004-08-04 00:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(840730, 94775, 8891, '<td valign="top">Boy do I like this shot....great shadows, movement, ghost like effects of the people walking out of the frame during what I''m guessing was a long exposure...I''ll give you some leeway in that it is at night and shot in moon light...but you really needed something a more discernible blue...I''m guessing the bike is blue, but it is not discernible on my monitor.....Maybe you could have made that large plastic thingie blue....Ah me....welll I go 7 cause I do like it but it would have done better with the blue.</td>', 'Boy do I like this shot....great shadows, movement, ghost like effects of the people walking out of the frame during what I''m guessing was a long exposure...I''ll give you some leeway in that it is at night and shot in moon light...but you really needed something a more discernible blue...I''m guessing the bike is blue, but it is not discernible on my monitor.....Maybe you could have made that large plastic thingie blue....Ah me....welll I go 7 cause I do like it but it would have done better with the blue.', '2004-08-04 00:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(840731, 95043, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and cropping.  I always love clouds reflected in windows.  I''m wondering if the auto-levels, contrasts and saturation in photoshop would have bumped it up a notch in the "WOW" category.</td>', 'I like the composition and cropping.  I always love clouds reflected in windows.  I''m wondering if the auto-levels, contrasts and saturation in photoshop would have bumped it up a notch in the "WOW" category.', '2004-08-04 00:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(840734, 94606, 24065, '<td valign="top">I came back and looked at the photograph again.  I must have been tired when I looked the first time.  I really like it.  I changed my score, too.  The perspective is very nice.  How did you get so close to the clouds and the earth at the same time?</td>', 'I came back and looked at the photograph again.  I must have been tired when I looked the first time.  I really like it.  I changed my score, too.  The perspective is very nice.  How did you get so close to the clouds and the earth at the same time?', '2004-08-04 00:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(840735, 94802, 23294, '<td valign="top">the rose looks great.  The pedals however I feel should be darker, they draw too much attention.  Overall very good, 8.</td>', 'the rose looks great.  The pedals however I feel should be darker, they draw too much attention.  Overall very good, 8.', '2004-08-04 00:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(840737, 94671, 24065, '<td valign="top">Altho your title calls for the inclusion of the disks, I just don''t like them there.  The moon, however, is beautiful.</td>', 'Altho your title calls for the inclusion of the disks, I just don''t like them there.  The moon, however, is beautiful.', '2004-08-04 00:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(840740, 95260, 24065, '<td valign="top">I came back and looked at this photgraph again and I must have been tired when I looked the first time.  So I updated my comment to say that I really like the orange and blue together.   I also find the composition appealing.</td>', 'I came back and looked at this photgraph again and I must have been tired when I looked the first time.  So I updated my comment to say that I really like the orange and blue together.   I also find the composition appealing.', '2004-08-04 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(840743, 95056, 23294, '<td valign="top">cool idea!  lighting is great, detail is there, and brilliant color.  8 overall.</td>', 'cool idea!  lighting is great, detail is there, and brilliant color.  8 overall.', '2004-08-04 00:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(840744, 94900, 23929, '<td valign="top">I like this. How did you do it?</td>', 'I like this. How did you do it?', '2004-08-04 00:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(840748, 94902, 23929, '<td valign="top">The shopper on the left is a bit distracting. A tighter crop might have been better?</td>', 'The shopper on the left is a bit distracting. A tighter crop might have been better?', '2004-08-04 00:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(840749, 94815, 24065, '<td valign="top">The firewoks effect is very nice.  Altho it is difficult to photography fireworks, you''ve done a nice job.  I would suggest trying to deepen the contast in a photo editing program to make the fireworks really pop out of the picture.</td>', 'The firewoks effect is very nice.  Altho it is difficult to photography fireworks, you''ve done a nice job.  I would suggest trying to deepen the contast in a photo editing program to make the fireworks really pop out of the picture.', '2004-08-04 00:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(840750, 94961, 23929, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2004-08-04 00:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(840752, 95341, 24065, '<td valign="top">The photgraph is very clear and very blue, but I just didn''t quite grasp the connection to the title.  The outfit is very creative, tho!</td>', 'The photgraph is very clear and very blue, but I just didn''t quite grasp the connection to the title.  The outfit is very creative, tho!', '2004-08-04 00:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(840755, 94693, 24065, '<td valign="top">I came back and looked at the photgraph again and it doesn''t appear dark at all.  I must have been very tired.  I''ve updated the comment and the score.  Very clear shot.</td>', 'I came back and looked at the photgraph again and it doesn''t appear dark at all.  I must have been very tired.  I''ve updated the comment and the score.  Very clear shot.', '2004-08-04 00:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(840757, 94813, 24065, '<td valign="top">The phot is very clear and the composition is good.  I think the darkness of the photograph is very appropriate for the subject matter.</td>', 'The phot is very clear and the composition is good.  I think the darkness of the photograph is very appropriate for the subject matter.', '2004-08-04 00:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(840760, 95123, 23929, '<td valign="top">Simple but beautiful.</td>', 'Simple but beautiful.', '2004-08-04 00:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(840763, 95248, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, but it appears more purple than blue.  Perhaps it''s just my monitor.  I tried and tried to get some good shots of my hosta when it was blooming, but just couldn''t do it.  I like your''s tho.  Wish I had thought of it.</td>', 'Nice photograph, but it appears more purple than blue.  Perhaps it''s just my monitor.  I tried and tried to get some good shots of my hosta when it was blooming, but just couldn''t do it.  I like your''s tho.  Wish I had thought of it.', '2004-08-04 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(840770, 94974, 23929, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the grainy effect. Like the piccy otherwise.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the grainy effect. Like the piccy otherwise.', '2004-08-04 00:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(840774, 95010, 24065, '<td valign="top">I have a lot of trouble getting everything into focus in my photographs, so I don''t know how to make a suggestion concerning the closer claw being a little blurred.  Otherwise this is a very interesting photograph.  I like the blue against the natural color.</td>', 'I have a lot of trouble getting everything into focus in my photographs, so I don''t know how to make a suggestion concerning the closer claw being a little blurred.  Otherwise this is a very interesting photograph.  I like the blue against the natural color.', '2004-08-04 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(840777, 94770, 13384, '<td valign="top">I actually like the DOF, but in the BLUE challenge - its a reach at best IMO</td>', 'I actually like the DOF, but in the BLUE challenge - its a reach at best IMO', '2004-08-04 00:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(840780, 94995, 24065, '<td valign="top">The photograph is very clear and pretty.  Putting it against a solid white background may have make it more dramatic.</td>', 'The photograph is very clear and pretty.  Putting it against a solid white background may have make it more dramatic.', '2004-08-04 00:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(840809, 94724, 23294, '<td valign="top">nice desaturation.  A lot of glare and a scratch on the guitar coulda been fixed.  8.</td>', 'nice desaturation.  A lot of glare and a scratch on the guitar coulda been fixed.  8.', '2004-08-04 01:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(840866, 94874, 24609, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  Contrasts tranquility of the Blue Moon and calm sea with the drama of the distant thunderstorm.  Great timing.  Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Well composed.  Contrasts tranquility of the Blue Moon and calm sea with the drama of the distant thunderstorm.  Great timing.  Wonderful shot.', '2004-08-04 01:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(841103, 95000, 22748, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Perfect title. Nice desat job. It really works well here. I like the cropping too; I wouldn''t have thought to crop it that way. Very unique. This photo is perfect. 10</td>', 'This is a great shot. Perfect title. Nice desat job. It really works well here. I like the cropping too; I wouldn''t have thought to crop it that way. Very unique. This photo is perfect. 10', '2004-08-04 02:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(841107, 95059, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great texture and color here.  It leaves the rest of the image up the viewer''s imagination...</td>', 'Great texture and color here.  It leaves the rest of the image up the viewer''s imagination...', '2004-08-04 02:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(841208, 95001, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool placement of the moon, but too rough and grainy. Also doesn''t look very blue.</td>', 'Cool placement of the moon, but too rough and grainy. Also doesn''t look very blue.', '2004-08-04 03:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(841216, 94848, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, beautiful picture. Love the sky.</td>', 'Very dramatic, beautiful picture. Love the sky.', '2004-08-04 03:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(841220, 94974, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect with the graininess. The blueness feels artificial for some reason though.</td>', 'Interesting effect with the graininess. The blueness feels artificial for some reason though.', '2004-08-04 03:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(841304, 95056, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro!!! This is really fabulous, I love the texture and color. Nice border too.</td>', 'Awesome macro!!! This is really fabulous, I love the texture and color. Nice border too.', '2004-08-04 03:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(841408, 95174, 21158, '<td valign="top">tighter crop to get rid of artifact at left and black edge at right</td>', 'tighter crop to get rid of artifact at left and black edge at right', '2004-08-04 05:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(841412, 94809, 21158, '<td valign="top">not crisp. too noisy</td>', 'not crisp. too noisy', '2004-08-04 05:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(841416, 95154, 21158, '<td valign="top">light box reflections are distracting</td>', 'light box reflections are distracting', '2004-08-04 05:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(841419, 95128, 21158, '<td valign="top">one of the better pics of this challenge</td>', 'one of the better pics of this challenge', '2004-08-04 05:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(841427, 95248, 21158, '<td valign="top">a tad soft at the top</td>', 'a tad soft at the top', '2004-08-04 05:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(841478, 95061, 23251, '<td valign="top">Just needed to be tilted a little...</td>', 'Just needed to be tilted a little...', '2004-08-04 07:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(841488, 94874, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!  Not sure but I think a slight crop at the top just so there was still a hint that the moon was there would have helped a bit. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot!  Not sure but I think a slight crop at the top just so there was still a hint that the moon was there would have helped a bit. Well done.', '2004-08-04 07:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(841490, 95056, 23251, '<td valign="top">The making of a fantastic photo...  Pity about those dark spots on the right!</td>', 'The making of a fantastic photo...  Pity about those dark spots on the right!', '2004-08-04 07:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(841497, 95174, 23251, '<td valign="top">The extra bit on the left should have been cloned out. Nice idea though.</td>', 'The extra bit on the left should have been cloned out. Nice idea though.', '2004-08-04 07:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(841585, 94975, 200, '<td valign="top">nice concept and title :)</td>', 'nice concept and title :)', '2004-08-04 09:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(841608, 94803, 23251, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but I think the moon spoils the mood.</td>', 'I like the shot but I think the moon spoils the mood.', '2004-08-04 09:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(841611, 94669, 25005, '<td valign="top">Very Good!!! Original....</td>', 'Very Good!!! Original....', '2004-08-04 09:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(841621, 94819, 25005, '<td valign="top">Great Shot...</td>', 'Great Shot...', '2004-08-04 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(841631, 94775, 25005, '<td valign="top">Where''s Blue?</td>', 'Where''s Blue?', '2004-08-04 09:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(841666, 95140, 25028, '<td valign="top">very painterly...  it''s interesting how a static composition (very well balanced and organized at that) takes on a dynamic life through colour, light, and texture.  :)</td>', 'very painterly...  it''s interesting how a static composition (very well balanced and organized at that) takes on a dynamic life through colour, light, and texture.  :)', '2004-08-04 10:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(841675, 95056, 25028, '<td valign="top">fascinating texture.</td>', 'fascinating texture.', '2004-08-04 10:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(841679, 95066, 25028, '<td valign="top">very well put! :)</td>', 'very well put! :)', '2004-08-04 10:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(841695, 94603, 25028, '<td valign="top">good dialogue between positive and negative space.  but slightly more daring cropping would have made for a more compelling image</td>', 'good dialogue between positive and negative space.  but slightly more daring cropping would have made for a more compelling image', '2004-08-04 10:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(841712, 95156, 22922, '<td valign="top">The persective here is off, so your shoulders look disproportiante to your torso.  Blue doesn''t really stand out. would possibly have worked without the wierd shirt.</td>', 'The persective here is off, so your shoulders look disproportiante to your torso.  Blue doesn''t really stand out. would possibly have worked without the wierd shirt.', '2004-08-04 10:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(841728, 94757, 22922, '<td valign="top">Same car, different challenge, still not a very interesting shot, but it''s blue.</td>', 'Same car, different challenge, still not a very interesting shot, but it''s blue.', '2004-08-04 10:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(841733, 95192, 25028, '<td valign="top">unique. well composed and good interplay of sharp/soft focus</td>', 'unique. well composed and good interplay of sharp/soft focus', '2004-08-04 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
