(843654, 94612, 23962, '<td valign="top">Thunderbirds are Go! Amazing contrast.</td>', 'Thunderbirds are Go! Amazing contrast.', '2004-08-05 00:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(843657, 95294, 23962, '<td valign="top">wow, what dynamics. You have an eye that will take you anywhere. This is really moody.</td>', 'wow, what dynamics. You have an eye that will take you anywhere. This is really moody.', '2004-08-05 00:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(843665, 94741, 23929, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop without the pirch might have worked better.</td>', 'A tighter crop without the pirch might have worked better.', '2004-08-05 00:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(843666, 94775, 23962, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. This pic is like a painting.</td>', 'Nice composition. This pic is like a painting.', '2004-08-05 00:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(843706, 94915, 23929, '<td valign="top">This would be good for the current challenge lol :)</td>', 'This would be good for the current challenge lol :)', '2004-08-05 00:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(843851, 95043, 4226, '<td valign="top">what looks to me is sky reflecions on some building glass ? am i wrong ?<br/>YOu could have improved this by saturating the blue ( more blue sky) and increasing the contrast.<br/></td>', 'what looks to me is sky reflecions on some building glass ? am i wrong ?YOu could have improved this by saturating the blue ( more blue sky) and increasing the contrast.', '2004-08-05 01:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(843875, 94894, 24416, '<td valign="top">i looove macroshots. and i loove blue. i looove this photo ;) im going to rate it 10!</td>', 'i looove macroshots. and i loove blue. i looove this photo ;) im going to rate it 10!', '2004-08-05 01:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(843907, 95190, 10261, '<td valign="top">Are the drops composed of window cleaner? Nice shot.</td>', 'Are the drops composed of window cleaner? Nice shot.', '2004-08-05 01:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(843911, 95046, 10261, '<td valign="top">Is this the surface of a ping-pong paddle? I like the shot, but wonder what it would have looked like if taken at a steeper angle and with a shallower depth of field.</td>', 'Is this the surface of a ping-pong paddle? I like the shot, but wonder what it would have looked like if taken at a steeper angle and with a shallower depth of field.', '2004-08-05 01:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(843915, 94715, 10261, '<td valign="top">I love the shadows that this casts.</td>', 'I love the shadows that this casts.', '2004-08-05 01:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(843923, 95027, 24659, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, very effective use of reflections and ripples!  Good!</td>', 'Nice and simple, very effective use of reflections and ripples!  Good!', '2004-08-05 01:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(843924, 95216, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the way that this image is cropped.</td>', 'I like the way that this image is cropped.', '2004-08-05 01:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(843925, 95093, 24659, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but I think the hat may detract from the eyes?  Just my liitle opinion.</td>', 'Good picture, but I think the hat may detract from the eyes?  Just my liitle opinion.', '2004-08-05 01:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(843929, 95190, 24659, '<td valign="top">Nice sprinkles, not sure if the blue droplets makes the picture more posed.  But appreciate the details.</td>', 'Nice sprinkles, not sure if the blue droplets makes the picture more posed.  But appreciate the details.', '2004-08-05 01:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(843931, 94700, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a very elegant looking bit of glass. What does the whole thing look like?<br/></td>', 'This is a very elegant looking bit of glass. What does the whole thing look like?', '2004-08-05 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(843932, 95081, 24659, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but I like it!</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at, but I like it!', '2004-08-05 01:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(843938, 94836, 10261, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but I can''t help but wonder how blue it was before filtration / post-processing.<br/></td>', 'I really like this picture, but I can''t help but wonder how blue it was before filtration / post-processing.', '2004-08-05 01:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(843947, 95320, 10261, '<td valign="top">The top of the iris seems a bit too shadowy. Very crisp detail on the rest of the eye though.<br/></td>', 'The top of the iris seems a bit too shadowy. Very crisp detail on the rest of the eye though.', '2004-08-05 01:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(843954, 94781, 10261, '<td valign="top">Goblets with tinted stems, viewed from inside the cup? Intriguing perspective.</td>', 'Goblets with tinted stems, viewed from inside the cup? Intriguing perspective.', '2004-08-05 01:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(843959, 94669, 10261, '<td valign="top">What was your light source for this picture? What did you use to apply the water to the glass?<br/> <br/>The left half of the "B" isn''t as discriminable from the background as I''d like to see. I like the depth effect created by holding the glass a bit above the surface below.<br/></td>', 'What was your light source for this picture? What did you use to apply the water to the glass? The left half of the "B" isn''t as discriminable from the background as I''d like to see. I like the depth effect created by holding the glass a bit above the surface below.', '2004-08-05 02:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(843976, 95122, 10261, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this image my eye followed the curve of the glass down to the bottom right corner, only to find that the focus was sharpest where the subject was the least interesting. I think that either the reflection on the glass should have crisp focus, allowing the blue to serve as the background, or that the blue should be the focal point. <br/></td>', 'When I first looked at this image my eye followed the curve of the glass down to the bottom right corner, only to find that the focus was sharpest where the subject was the least interesting. I think that either the reflection on the glass should have crisp focus, allowing the blue to serve as the background, or that the blue should be the focal point. ', '2004-08-05 02:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(843984, 94683, 10261, '<td valign="top">Focusing on the dim reflection while relegating the real world to a bright blur seems to embody the image''s title rather well.</td>', 'Focusing on the dim reflection while relegating the real world to a bright blur seems to embody the image''s title rather well.', '2004-08-05 02:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(843989, 95056, 10261, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. How was the feather lit?</td>', 'Excellent photo. How was the feather lit?', '2004-08-05 02:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(844003, 94775, 10261, '<td valign="top">While this is an interesting scene, I see neither blue nor the moon in this picture. The shadow cast by the bicycle and the phantom children in the background are interesting compositional elements.<br/></td>', 'While this is an interesting scene, I see neither blue nor the moon in this picture. The shadow cast by the bicycle and the phantom children in the background are interesting compositional elements.', '2004-08-05 02:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(844011, 94972, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d like to rate this higher, but the two reported subjects are both indistinct blurs. Aah, the joys of photographing in low light.<br/></td>', 'I''d like to rate this higher, but the two reported subjects are both indistinct blurs. Aah, the joys of photographing in low light.', '2004-08-05 02:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(844020, 95185, 10261, '<td valign="top">The building is attractive, but I think that it needs a person or two inside to make it more interesting. Since the architecture is fanciful and the topic is blue, perhaps a fleeing Cinderella and a companionless Prince Charming would be in order.<br/></td>', 'The building is attractive, but I think that it needs a person or two inside to make it more interesting. Since the architecture is fanciful and the topic is blue, perhaps a fleeing Cinderella and a companionless Prince Charming would be in order.', '2004-08-05 02:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(844023, 95209, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous view of an object we all know, but I''ve never seen it like this before. It looks like one of those illusions with all the cubes and stuff...</td>', 'Fabulous view of an object we all know, but I''ve never seen it like this before. It looks like one of those illusions with all the cubes and stuff...', '2004-08-05 02:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(844032, 94747, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool composition. Sure, it''s a blue sky, everyone takes pics of it, but the foreground object adds something of interest.</td>', 'Cool composition. Sure, it''s a blue sky, everyone takes pics of it, but the foreground object adds something of interest.', '2004-08-05 02:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(844034, 95080, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures in this. Nice crisp photo.</td>', 'I like the colors and textures in this. Nice crisp photo.', '2004-08-05 02:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(844035, 94924, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good sharp picture, interesting DOF. I like the textures of the paperclip coating.</td>', 'Nice. Good sharp picture, interesting DOF. I like the textures of the paperclip coating.', '2004-08-05 02:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(844038, 94762, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great composition! I love the texture of the ball and the reflection. The drops on it are cool. The colors are great. The pic is a big grainy though, especially in the dark areas of the ball.  Good border.</td>', 'Great composition! I love the texture of the ball and the reflection. The drops on it are cool. The colors are great. The pic is a big grainy though, especially in the dark areas of the ball.  Good border.', '2004-08-05 02:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(844101, 94900, 24240, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Sort of a yin yang with attitude.</td>', 'Very nice.  Sort of a yin yang with attitude.', '2004-08-05 04:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(844104, 95166, 24240, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Caught a moment of nature''s art in small town America.  I feel I am there.</td>', 'I like it.  Caught a moment of nature''s art in small town America.  I feel I am there.', '2004-08-05 04:04:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(844105, 95330, 24240, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the essence of blueness.  Nice texture</td>', 'You''ve captured the essence of blueness.  Nice texture', '2004-08-05 04:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(844108, 95288, 24240, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition in terms of color contrast, balance and light and dark</td>', 'Very nice composition in terms of color contrast, balance and light and dark', '2004-08-05 04:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(844109, 95275, 24240, '<td valign="top">Cool, er, hot idea!</td>', 'Cool, er, hot idea!', '2004-08-05 04:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(844117, 94618, 24486, '<td valign="top">Cool colour contrasts</td>', 'Cool colour contrasts', '2004-08-05 04:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(844119, 94796, 24805, '<td valign="top">cluttered background detracts from the subject. try exlporing more intentional compositions and angles. cool car!</td>', 'cluttered background detracts from the subject. try exlporing more intentional compositions and angles. cool car!', '2004-08-05 04:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(844121, 94886, 24805, '<td valign="top">erie, but it works. i think the composition would work better if you allowed more negative space above the moon and to the right of the people</td>', 'erie, but it works. i think the composition would work better if you allowed more negative space above the moon and to the right of the people', '2004-08-05 04:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(844122, 95200, 24805, '<td valign="top">great technical quality. i know you need blue, but the house really doesn''t seem to contribute the the image</td>', 'great technical quality. i know you need blue, but the house really doesn''t seem to contribute the the image', '2004-08-05 04:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(844124, 95081, 24805, '<td valign="top">wild</td>', 'wild', '2004-08-05 04:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(844126, 95231, 24805, '<td valign="top">yikes!</td>', 'yikes!', '2004-08-05 04:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(844154, 94778, 24486, '<td valign="top">good sharpness and DOF</td>', 'good sharpness and DOF', '2004-08-05 05:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(844156, 94762, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good strong contrast</td>', 'Good strong contrast', '2004-08-05 05:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(844157, 94717, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great effect. The scribble is a nice touch too</td>', 'Great effect. The scribble is a nice touch too', '2004-08-05 05:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(844164, 95016, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice hint of movement in the tail</td>', 'Great shot. Nice hint of movement in the tail', '2004-08-05 05:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(844166, 94572, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The foreground is a little distracting but I think you have achieved DOF.</td>', 'Good concept. The foreground is a little distracting but I think you have achieved DOF.', '2004-08-05 05:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(844171, 95086, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool. Super sharp shot. Great focus. Excellent color and contrast. Nice textures. Interesting perspective and framing.</td>', 'Cool. Super sharp shot. Great focus. Excellent color and contrast. Nice textures. Interesting perspective and framing.', '2004-08-05 06:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(844172, 95336, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Pattern, color and texture are great.  Nice how it''s darker around the edges, like a little vignetting. I might prefer it smoother, without the graininess, but it''s still pretty nice.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Pattern, color and texture are great.  Nice how it''s darker around the edges, like a little vignetting. I might prefer it smoother, without the graininess, but it''s still pretty nice.', '2004-08-05 06:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(844174, 94613, 24486, '<td valign="top">The title says it all</td>', 'The title says it all', '2004-08-05 06:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(844175, 94728, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good reflection shot. But, it''s a bit blurry and blocky, probably mainly because you used such high JPEG compression. This image is 29K, you have 150K to use! If you use a higher quality setting when saving to the JPEG file, it will look a hundred times better.<br/> <br/>Also I would recommend a polarizing filter on shots like this, it will make the sky a deeper blue. You could help a little by bumping up the blue in Photoshop with the curves dialog. Especially since this is the BLUE challenge... :) It could use a tiny bit more "kick" to the blue since it''s kind of overpowered by the rich greens.</td>', 'Good reflection shot. But, it''s a bit blurry and blocky, probably mainly because you used such high JPEG compression. This image is 29K, you have 150K to use! If you use a higher quality setting when saving to the JPEG file, it will look a hundred times better. Also I would recommend a polarizing filter on shots like this, it will make the sky a deeper blue. You could help a little by bumping up the blue in Photoshop with the curves dialog. Especially since this is the BLUE challenge... :) It could use a tiny bit more "kick" to the blue since it''s kind of overpowered by the rich greens.', '2004-08-05 06:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(844176, 95271, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. I like the color and shape.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. I like the color and shape.', '2004-08-05 06:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(844177, 94747, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good perspective</td>', 'Good perspective', '2004-08-05 06:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(844178, 95070, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice, original, moody, well done shot.  The lighting is great. I wish the green bottle on the right weren''t there though, it''s too much green and only in that one part of the picture and throws off the balance a little to me... more blue bottles and cans would be better.</td>', 'Nice, original, moody, well done shot.  The lighting is great. I wish the green bottle on the right weren''t there though, it''s too much green and only in that one part of the picture and throws off the balance a little to me... more blue bottles and cans would be better.', '2004-08-05 06:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(844180, 95335, 22748, '<td valign="top">One of the best pattern shots I''ve seen in the challenge. Nice angles and interesting lighting make for interesting geometry. I wish the blue was more saturated and deep though, it''s a bit too whitish.</td>', 'One of the best pattern shots I''ve seen in the challenge. Nice angles and interesting lighting make for interesting geometry. I wish the blue was more saturated and deep though, it''s a bit too whitish.', '2004-08-05 06:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(844181, 94752, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Good contrasts.</td>', 'Good composition. Good contrasts.', '2004-08-05 06:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(844183, 95280, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Is it blue? Maybe. The sky makes part of it look blue. Looks like the antenna is waving in the wind. :) It''s nice and smooth but I think I need more lines to help my eyes know where to look, or maybe more things of interest in the reflection to look at?</td>', 'Interesting. Is it blue? Maybe. The sky makes part of it look blue. Looks like the antenna is waving in the wind. :) It''s nice and smooth but I think I need more lines to help my eyes know where to look, or maybe more things of interest in the reflection to look at?', '2004-08-05 06:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(844184, 95081, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. It looks like a mirror is set up behind the glass and tilted forward. Nice color. There''s some weird refracted light pattern in front of the base that is distracting though. Also the lighting is very flat (seems to be in line with the camera) maybe some more interesting lighting would define some more shape and help make the image ''pop'' a little more.</td>', 'Nice idea. It looks like a mirror is set up behind the glass and tilted forward. Nice color. There''s some weird refracted light pattern in front of the base that is distracting though. Also the lighting is very flat (seems to be in line with the camera) maybe some more interesting lighting would define some more shape and help make the image ''pop'' a little more.', '2004-08-05 06:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(844185, 94757, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nicely done shot. It''s sharp, clean, and the background is nice and white. It doesn''t catch my interest that much, though. I think some indication of motion or action would help, maybe  some motion blur or even a panning shot? Also I find that getting down really low on shots like this sometimes gives a more exciting perspective.</td>', 'Nicely done shot. It''s sharp, clean, and the background is nice and white. It doesn''t catch my interest that much, though. I think some indication of motion or action would help, maybe  some motion blur or even a panning shot? Also I find that getting down really low on shots like this sometimes gives a more exciting perspective.', '2004-08-05 06:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(844186, 95061, 24486, '<td valign="top">A bit too much light at the bottom of the picture. The bottom of the glass and part of the bottle are not clearly defined otherwise a good photograph</td>', 'A bit too much light at the bottom of the picture. The bottom of the glass and part of the bottle are not clearly defined otherwise a good photograph', '2004-08-05 06:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(844187, 94771, 24486, '<td valign="top">definate WOW factor</td>', 'definate WOW factor', '2004-08-05 06:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(844188, 94975, 22748, '<td valign="top">The feel of the photo is a little dark and seems to fit well with the title. The patterns are interesting but I think a different angle on them might make the image more eye-catching.</td>', 'The feel of the photo is a little dark and seems to fit well with the title. The patterns are interesting but I think a different angle on them might make the image more eye-catching.', '2004-08-05 06:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(844189, 94905, 24486, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colours.Good DOF</td>', 'Nice contrasting colours.Good DOF', '2004-08-05 06:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(844192, 95340, 22748, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty nice, good and even, but the big highlight in the pitcher is distracting. Also the pedestal is a little to bright compared to the pitcher, which seems to be the focal point of the composition and the pedestal is trying to steal its thunder. We can''t let that happen... :)</td>', 'The lighting is pretty nice, good and even, but the big highlight in the pitcher is distracting. Also the pedestal is a little to bright compared to the pitcher, which seems to be the focal point of the composition and the pedestal is trying to steal its thunder. We can''t let that happen... :)', '2004-08-05 06:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(844193, 94837, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the highlight on the face, that''s a great touch.The background could be better though, I think the color is a little distracting from the nice blue of the angel.</td>', 'I like the highlight on the face, that''s a great touch.The background could be better though, I think the color is a little distracting from the nice blue of the angel.', '2004-08-05 06:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(844194, 95116, 24486, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-08-05 06:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(844195, 94794, 22748, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition. The moon and cactus and the horizon and the sky are great. But _really_, 12K for an image? You have up to 150K. There are weird-colored blocky JPEG artifacts surrounding the moon and cactii. Just turn up the quality when you save to JPEG, and use as much space as you need to. Don''t forget to preview your submission and make sure it looks as good as it did before you uploaded it. Best of luck on your next entries.</td>', 'I really like the composition. The moon and cactus and the horizon and the sky are great. But _really_, 12K for an image? You have up to 150K. There are weird-colored blocky JPEG artifacts surrounding the moon and cactii. Just turn up the quality when you save to JPEG, and use as much space as you need to. Don''t forget to preview your submission and make sure it looks as good as it did before you uploaded it. Best of luck on your next entries.', '2004-08-05 06:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(844197, 94678, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the composition but I''d like to see a bluer blue there''s a lot of green here it seems like. The glow around the person, intentional or not, is really cool though.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the composition but I''d like to see a bluer blue there''s a lot of green here it seems like. The glow around the person, intentional or not, is really cool though.', '2004-08-05 06:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(844199, 95327, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The water droplets really add a lot here, I''m glad you put them in. Looks like a butterfly collection or something! :)</td>', 'Nice shot. The water droplets really add a lot here, I''m glad you put them in. Looks like a butterfly collection or something! :)', '2004-08-05 06:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(844200, 94619, 22748, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, I like the atmospheric peaceful feel this image has.</td>', 'Pretty nice, I like the atmospheric peaceful feel this image has.', '2004-08-05 06:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(844201, 94675, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The crop at the bottom edge feels a little tight though.<br/>It would be nice if the glass was more brightly lit, mainly at the bottom, it''s hard because the lemon is so bright in comparison. The background is really patchy and blocky, must be a JPEG artifact? The image is reasonably large &gt;100K so it shouldn''t be that bad. Dunno. But it''s still a nice composition.</td>', 'Nice photo. The crop at the bottom edge feels a little tight though.It would be nice if the glass was more brightly lit, mainly at the bottom, it''s hard because the lemon is so bright in comparison. The background is really patchy and blocky, must be a JPEG artifact? The image is reasonably large >100K so it shouldn''t be that bad. Dunno. But it''s still a nice composition.', '2004-08-05 06:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(844203, 94692, 22748, '<td valign="top">A little noisy on the blue, but it needs to be brighter anyway for me to really see the blue. The pink and white colors really dominate the scene.</td>', 'A little noisy on the blue, but it needs to be brighter anyway for me to really see the blue. The pink and white colors really dominate the scene.', '2004-08-05 06:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(844209, 94802, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, so vivid! This is the deepest, richest blue I remember seeing in the challenge. Very nice. Is it dyed? Or hue-shifted? Surely there aren''t roses really that color in nature? The light on the leaf (or whatever the things are) on the left and on the bottom left is a little distracting because it''s so bright but it would be difficult I''m sure to fix without taking away the vividness of the flower itself.</td>', 'Wow, so vivid! This is the deepest, richest blue I remember seeing in the challenge. Very nice. Is it dyed? Or hue-shifted? Surely there aren''t roses really that color in nature? The light on the leaf (or whatever the things are) on the left and on the bottom left is a little distracting because it''s so bright but it would be difficult I''m sure to fix without taking away the vividness of the flower itself.', '2004-08-05 06:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(844216, 95332, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, if I squint at this it''s my favorite in the challenge. But I wish it weren''t quite so grainy. It''s got some weird vertical lines in it upon closer inspection, and after looking at it for a while the noise is bothering me a lot. The composition and lighting is superb though, so 8 anyway.</td>', 'Wow, if I squint at this it''s my favorite in the challenge. But I wish it weren''t quite so grainy. It''s got some weird vertical lines in it upon closer inspection, and after looking at it for a while the noise is bothering me a lot. The composition and lighting is superb though, so 8 anyway.', '2004-08-05 06:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(844220, 95307, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great color combination. I like how the yellow/orange light creates highlights on the glass.</td>', 'Great color combination. I like how the yellow/orange light creates highlights on the glass.', '2004-08-05 06:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(844226, 94835, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nicely done studio shot. It seems weird focusing on the bill of the cap though. If the DOF were deep enough to capture the whole scene in sharp focus, that would be fine, but if only one thing is in focus, I would prefer it be the LA logo or maybe the closest part of the glove. But here it just feels blurry because the important parts are not focused.</td>', 'Nicely done studio shot. It seems weird focusing on the bill of the cap though. If the DOF were deep enough to capture the whole scene in sharp focus, that would be fine, but if only one thing is in focus, I would prefer it be the LA logo or maybe the closest part of the glove. But here it just feels blurry because the important parts are not focused.', '2004-08-05 06:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(844227, 95243, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. Wonder what he''s holding on to? It''s not a ski rope, is it? why is the bar so long? The crop''s a little tight though.</td>', 'Good action shot. Wonder what he''s holding on to? It''s not a ski rope, is it? why is the bar so long? The crop''s a little tight though.', '2004-08-05 06:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
