(844972, 94805, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. The color and contrast are great. Nice sharpness. Nice reflections and nice lighting. Great angle, most car pics are taken from boring angles like directly from the side or back, good interesting cropping makes it better.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. The color and contrast are great. Nice sharpness. Nice reflections and nice lighting. Great angle, most car pics are taken from boring angles like directly from the side or back, good interesting cropping makes it better.', '2004-08-05 17:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
