(845050, 95216, 20115, '<td valign="top">I really like this--it''s a little scary though.  Not crazy about piercing--don''t quite know why anyone is compelled to do it.  But this is very creative and sensual.</td>', 'I really like this--it''s a little scary though.  Not crazy about piercing--don''t quite know why anyone is compelled to do it.  But this is very creative and sensual.', '2004-08-05 17:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(845051, 94936, 22748, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, nice deep blue color. I like it.</td>', 'Ooooh, nice deep blue color. I like it.', '2004-08-05 17:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(845053, 95127, 9690, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm... ok, but the trees are blue too! Im not sure I like that</td>', 'Hmmmmm... ok, but the trees are blue too! Im not sure I like that', '2004-08-05 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(845056, 95322, 9690, '<td valign="top">Like the shadowing!</td>', 'Like the shadowing!', '2004-08-05 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(845060, 95001, 20115, '<td valign="top">Direct moon shots are very difficult with digital I find.  Never tried with film, but think the outcome would be different.  I think the moon needs to be sharp--but maybe it''s impossible.</td>', 'Direct moon shots are very difficult with digital I find.  Never tried with film, but think the outcome would be different.  I think the moon needs to be sharp--but maybe it''s impossible.', '2004-08-05 17:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(845061, 94802, 9690, '<td valign="top">Cool.  I think this may have been improved by removing the color from the stem.  This blue and green do not do much for each other<br/></td>', 'Cool.  I think this may have been improved by removing the color from the stem.  This blue and green do not do much for each other', '2004-08-05 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(845064, 94673, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that your subject goes from corner to corner</td>', 'I like the fact that your subject goes from corner to corner', '2004-08-05 17:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(845072, 94880, 9690, '<td valign="top">Not very exciting at all.  The blues are rather subdued.  What is the viewer supposed to get out of this??</td>', 'Not very exciting at all.  The blues are rather subdued.  What is the viewer supposed to get out of this??', '2004-08-05 17:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(845074, 95010, 9690, '<td valign="top">Creepy to say the least.  The only thing i dont like about this one is the fact that the claw closest to me is out of focus</td>', 'Creepy to say the least.  The only thing i dont like about this one is the fact that the claw closest to me is out of focus', '2004-08-05 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(845075, 94572, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. It''s pretty abstract since the moon is so blown out and everything else is blurred. Nice blue halo around the moon.</td>', 'Interesting shot. It''s pretty abstract since the moon is so blown out and everything else is blurred. Nice blue halo around the moon.', '2004-08-05 17:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(845076, 95177, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good framing. Really nice blue color.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good framing. Really nice blue color.', '2004-08-05 17:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(845081, 94997, 9690, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rock.  Did you find this yourself, or purchase it?  The lighting seems to be a bit forced, but i know how hard it can be to light a reflective subject</td>', 'Beautiful rock.  Did you find this yourself, or purchase it?  The lighting seems to be a bit forced, but i know how hard it can be to light a reflective subject', '2004-08-05 17:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(845084, 94898, 9690, '<td valign="top">Unique idean and unique use of framing.  I like that.  The focus seems a little soft, and i would have shot for a greater depth of field.  The lettering on the bottom of the tube is clearly more out of focus than the other lettering.  Also, it may have helped to tweak the blue a little bit to make it "pop" more and become more vivid.  Maybe just a different paint would help ~8</td>', 'Unique idean and unique use of framing.  I like that.  The focus seems a little soft, and i would have shot for a greater depth of field.  The lettering on the bottom of the tube is clearly more out of focus than the other lettering.  Also, it may have helped to tweak the blue a little bit to make it "pop" more and become more vivid.  Maybe just a different paint would help ~8', '2004-08-05 17:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(845090, 94889, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract shot. Nice shapes and colors. It would be nice if it were bigger, and maybe cropped tighter or zoomed in more on the interesting stuff, I''d like a closer looked at the cool swirly patterns.</td>', 'Cool abstract shot. Nice shapes and colors. It would be nice if it were bigger, and maybe cropped tighter or zoomed in more on the interesting stuff, I''d like a closer looked at the cool swirly patterns.', '2004-08-05 17:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(845096, 95322, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice color, nice textures on the marbles. Cool lighting and refractions and shadows.  Nice slightly soft feel to the image. A little too much noise in the background, but this is a great, great photo. This should ribbon.</td>', 'Nice color, nice textures on the marbles. Cool lighting and refractions and shadows.  Nice slightly soft feel to the image. A little too much noise in the background, but this is a great, great photo. This should ribbon.', '2004-08-05 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(845116, 94936, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2004-08-05 17:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(845122, 95119, 24642, '<td valign="top">Clever title, maybee a shallower DOF would have helped to "sharpen" the knife.</td>', 'Clever title, maybee a shallower DOF would have helped to "sharpen" the knife.', '2004-08-05 17:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(845128, 94961, 24642, '<td valign="top">Could a different background colour help? I also think the cropping is to tight.</td>', 'Could a different background colour help? I also think the cropping is to tight.', '2004-08-05 17:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(845132, 94626, 24642, '<td valign="top">I won''t. Very nice framing, focus and choice of colours.</td>', 'I won''t. Very nice framing, focus and choice of colours.', '2004-08-05 17:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(845135, 95027, 24642, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2004-08-05 17:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(845141, 95307, 24642, '<td valign="top">IMHO the backround does not harmonize with the glass.</td>', 'IMHO the backround does not harmonize with the glass.', '2004-08-05 17:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(845150, 95315, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice colour,good title,  lacks framing and maybee a different viewpoint would help?</td>', 'Nice colour,good title,  lacks framing and maybee a different viewpoint would help?', '2004-08-05 17:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(845152, 95231, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh, really cool. I like it. The rest of the mug is a bit overexposed at some places though and it''s hard to separate it from the background. Nice interesting image.</td>', 'Oooh, really cool. I like it. The rest of the mug is a bit overexposed at some places though and it''s hard to separate it from the background. Nice interesting image.', '2004-08-05 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(845156, 95181, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro. Not a huge wow factor but still an interesting shot. The lighting does a good job of highlighting the texture of the seal.</td>', 'Interesting macro. Not a huge wow factor but still an interesting shot. The lighting does a good job of highlighting the texture of the seal.', '2004-08-05 17:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(845157, 95149, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Nice composition.</td>', 'Great colors. Nice composition.', '2004-08-05 17:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(845158, 95156, 22748, '<td valign="top">Not bad, I would if a different angle could make it more exciting though? Maybe this is exciting enough for the ladies, though.... ;)</td>', 'Not bad, I would if a different angle could make it more exciting though? Maybe this is exciting enough for the ladies, though.... ;)', '2004-08-05 17:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(845166, 95160, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Nice smooth feel to it.</td>', 'Cool shot. Nice smooth feel to it.', '2004-08-05 18:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(845179, 94700, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo! I love the smoothness in this shot. Excellent quality here, sharp focus, very little JPEG artifacts in the background, really nice.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo! I love the smoothness in this shot. Excellent quality here, sharp focus, very little JPEG artifacts in the background, really nice.', '2004-08-05 18:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(845182, 95123, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very cool. The blue is a really rich color.</td>', 'Very cool. The blue is a really rich color.', '2004-08-05 18:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(845184, 95016, 3569, '<td valign="top">Simply perfect.... After reviewing and voting yours is definately the best of show by far.</td>', 'Simply perfect.... After reviewing and voting yours is definately the best of show by far.', '2004-08-05 18:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(845187, 95153, 24048, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, could have had more blue</td>', 'Nice composition, could have had more blue', '2004-08-05 18:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(845189, 94961, 24048, '<td valign="top">Wow, great specimen and good macro.  Placing it on the top third of the photo would have really made this a 9</td>', 'Wow, great specimen and good macro.  Placing it on the top third of the photo would have really made this a 9', '2004-08-05 18:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(845191, 94934, 24048, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color</td>', 'Great composition and color', '2004-08-05 18:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(845192, 94936, 24048, '<td valign="top">Cool! Nice composition!  How did you do it?</td>', 'Cool! Nice composition!  How did you do it?', '2004-08-05 18:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(845196, 94775, 24048, '<td valign="top">Blue?</td>', 'Blue?', '2004-08-05 18:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(845199, 95331, 24048, '<td valign="top">Fun!  Good composition, maybe a half-second too soon though.  It would have been dynamite if her legs were straight.</td>', 'Fun!  Good composition, maybe a half-second too soon though.  It would have been dynamite if her legs were straight.', '2004-08-05 18:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(845200, 94755, 24048, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good Composition!</td>', 'Nice!  Good Composition!', '2004-08-05 18:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(845205, 94742, 24048, '<td valign="top">!</td>', '!', '2004-08-05 18:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(845208, 94692, 24048, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes the shapes a bit indistinct, maybe try something on the upper left/right as well to give some dimension.  Nice work.</td>', 'The lighting makes the shapes a bit indistinct, maybe try something on the upper left/right as well to give some dimension.  Nice work.', '2004-08-05 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(845209, 94840, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections, nice color and good capture of the firework, I know how difficult it is to have the right timing, by experience... :)</td>', 'Nice reflections, nice color and good capture of the firework, I know how difficult it is to have the right timing, by experience... :)', '2004-08-05 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(845213, 95093, 24048, '<td valign="top">Fun!  Nice!</td>', 'Fun!  Nice!', '2004-08-05 18:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(845214, 94863, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns, but I might have cropped out the distracting shadow at the bottom just right of center.</td>', 'Nice patterns, but I might have cropped out the distracting shadow at the bottom just right of center.', '2004-08-05 18:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(845217, 95119, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, interesting subject. Too bad it''s quite so blurry. I like the crop.</td>', 'Nice colors, interesting subject. Too bad it''s quite so blurry. I like the crop.', '2004-08-05 18:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(845223, 95325, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture and color on the pipe! The background works great here. (I would probably have cloned out the little piece of grass sticking in front of the pipe near the bottom though but no biggie.)</td>', 'Beautiful texture and color on the pipe! The background works great here. (I would probably have cloned out the little piece of grass sticking in front of the pipe near the bottom though but no biggie.)', '2004-08-05 18:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(845225, 94909, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice image. All the repeated umbrellas are pretty neat from this perspective.</td>', 'Nice image. All the repeated umbrellas are pretty neat from this perspective.', '2004-08-05 18:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(845235, 94712, 24048, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Could be improved by putting the pencil closer to the rt third of the photo.</td>', 'Nice!  Could be improved by putting the pencil closer to the rt third of the photo.', '2004-08-05 18:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(845237, 94609, 22748, '<td valign="top">Kinda cool, makes you think about it for a minute. Some funky color conversions in Photoshop maybe? That''s maybe some Martian species of fir, perhaps.</td>', 'Kinda cool, makes you think about it for a minute. Some funky color conversions in Photoshop maybe? That''s maybe some Martian species of fir, perhaps.', '2004-08-05 18:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(845240, 94710, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Sharp and nice lighting. I like the color of the bottle at the bottom much better than at the top though where the greens from outside contaminate the blue and make it much duller, I might try a less distracting background.</td>', 'Nice shot. Sharp and nice lighting. I like the color of the bottle at the bottom much better than at the top though where the greens from outside contaminate the blue and make it much duller, I might try a less distracting background.', '2004-08-05 18:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(845254, 95255, 24805, '<td valign="top">it''s a good picutre, but there doesnn''t seem to be anything special about it.</td>', 'it''s a good picutre, but there doesnn''t seem to be anything special about it.', '2004-08-05 18:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(845255, 94894, 24805, '<td valign="top">;o). a smoother background might make the image easier on the eye</td>', ';o). a smoother background might make the image easier on the eye', '2004-08-05 18:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(845256, 95131, 24805, '<td valign="top">irony abounds. well done</td>', 'irony abounds. well done', '2004-08-05 18:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(845257, 95141, 24805, '<td valign="top">technically it''s great. i''m not sure why, but i just don''t find anything about it especially captivating.</td>', 'technically it''s great. i''m not sure why, but i just don''t find anything about it especially captivating.', '2004-08-05 18:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(845259, 95210, 24805, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition of shapes and tone and color. 9</td>', 'beautiful composition of shapes and tone and color. 9', '2004-08-05 18:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(845261, 94936, 24805, '<td valign="top">captivating. i''ts beautiful and strange--i like it</td>', 'captivating. i''ts beautiful and strange--i like it', '2004-08-05 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(845262, 95001, 24805, '<td valign="top">it''s a shame about the noise. great shadows on the courthouse. the tree detracts from the composition</td>', 'it''s a shame about the noise. great shadows on the courthouse. the tree detracts from the composition', '2004-08-05 18:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(845266, 94616, 15800, '<td valign="top">Very crisp colors!  I would''ve liked to see the man a little further to the right, but otherwise it''s an awesome photo!!</td>', 'Very crisp colors!  I would''ve liked to see the man a little further to the right, but otherwise it''s an awesome photo!!', '2004-08-05 18:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(845269, 94900, 24805, '<td valign="top">this image is beautiful. i think it would work better if you had either cropped in tighter or left the big drop more room to breath on the edges. as cool as it is there have been a lot of frozen "splash" images and it''s starting to loose its magic.</td>', 'this image is beautiful. i think it would work better if you had either cropped in tighter or left the big drop more room to breath on the edges. as cool as it is there have been a lot of frozen "splash" images and it''s starting to loose its magic.', '2004-08-05 18:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(845271, 95165, 24805, '<td valign="top">great concept. the burnout of highlight information is a little excessive.</td>', 'great concept. the burnout of highlight information is a little excessive.', '2004-08-05 18:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(845272, 95336, 24805, '<td valign="top">come one. this is a photography contest--not a gallery of photoshop ripple filters</td>', 'come one. this is a photography contest--not a gallery of photoshop ripple filters', '2004-08-05 18:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(845275, 95016, 15800, '<td valign="top">National Geographic worthy!!</td>', 'National Geographic worthy!!', '2004-08-05 18:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(845276, 95076, 24805, '<td valign="top">great job catching the expression. the focus feels just a tiny bit soft (nothing the unsharp filter couldn''t handle). The background is what needs work. First step is to get something with only one tone, next step is to pick a contrasting color. I''d like to see a darker green or neutral backgound.  the blurred foreground element in the left side is unorthodox, but compliments the expresion well. 8</td>', 'great job catching the expression. the focus feels just a tiny bit soft (nothing the unsharp filter couldn''t handle). The background is what needs work. First step is to get something with only one tone, next step is to pick a contrasting color. I''d like to see a darker green or neutral backgound.  the blurred foreground element in the left side is unorthodox, but compliments the expresion well. 8', '2004-08-05 18:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(845277, 95093, 24805, '<td valign="top">it''s a good picture but it really isn''t my style</td>', 'it''s a good picture but it really isn''t my style', '2004-08-05 18:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(845278, 95060, 24805, '<td valign="top">the crop feels uncomfortably tight. in an image this simple the grain shouldn''t have been hard to remove.</td>', 'the crop feels uncomfortably tight. in an image this simple the grain shouldn''t have been hard to remove.', '2004-08-05 18:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(845279, 95002, 24805, '<td valign="top">beautiful. it feels like at least a few hues got blasted out. this adds to the initial impact, but causes the image to loose interest the more you look at it</td>', 'beautiful. it feels like at least a few hues got blasted out. this adds to the initial impact, but causes the image to loose interest the more you look at it', '2004-08-05 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(845282, 95056, 24805, '<td valign="top">well done, the color and tones lend to a very sophisticated feel. i think i''d like it better if it were either all crystal clear, or if the blurry areas were evey blurier</td>', 'well done, the color and tones lend to a very sophisticated feel. i think i''d like it better if it were either all crystal clear, or if the blurry areas were evey blurier', '2004-08-05 18:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(845283, 95159, 24805, '<td valign="top">blue?</td>', 'blue?', '2004-08-05 18:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(845284, 95210, 20853, '<td valign="top">Original!  I really like this one.</td>', 'Original!  I really like this one.', '2004-08-05 18:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(845288, 95148, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh! Fabulous! This is one of my favorite pics ever! Makes me wonder if this is EddyG''s or bod''s image (my idols)... hmmm.... I love the hot/cold color contrast and the whole way the clear bulb looks with the blue background. I''d really like to know how it was done (blue cloth background lit from the sides?). The colors are vivid, everything is clean and sharp. The composition is simple and elegant. I like how the background fades to a darker shade in the upper left and lower right corners; it balances the photo because of the angle the bulb is at. BRILLIANT!!! 10</td>', 'Oooh! Fabulous! This is one of my favorite pics ever! Makes me wonder if this is EddyG''s or bod''s image (my idols)... hmmm.... I love the hot/cold color contrast and the whole way the clear bulb looks with the blue background. I''d really like to know how it was done (blue cloth background lit from the sides?). The colors are vivid, everything is clean and sharp. The composition is simple and elegant. I like how the background fades to a darker shade in the upper left and lower right corners; it balances the photo because of the angle the bulb is at. BRILLIANT!!! 10', '2004-08-05 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(845334, 94766, 16790, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this is fantastic, and the deep blue sky is well complimented by the rusty colours of the building.  Composition is excellent, and the image is very sharp.  Nice job.</td>', 'The simplicity of this is fantastic, and the deep blue sky is well complimented by the rusty colours of the building.  Composition is excellent, and the image is very sharp.  Nice job.', '2004-08-05 19:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(845338, 95148, 3697, '<td valign="top">What incredible clarity and color! Oh, and great composition too :) One of this week''s best.</td>', 'What incredible clarity and color! Oh, and great composition too :) One of this week''s best.', '2004-08-05 19:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(845339, 95185, 16790, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but the colours feel either too heavily shifted or over-saturated; I think the heaviness of the blues and greens really overpower it.  It''s a gorgeous scene though, and the picture is well composed.  6</td>', 'I really like this photo, but the colours feel either too heavily shifted or over-saturated; I think the heaviness of the blues and greens really overpower it.  It''s a gorgeous scene though, and the picture is well composed.  6', '2004-08-05 19:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(845340, 95260, 16790, '<td valign="top">The focus on this feels a bit soft, but the colours and composition are excellent.</td>', 'The focus on this feels a bit soft, but the colours and composition are excellent.', '2004-08-05 19:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(845343, 95340, 16790, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this one better with a tad more empty space above the glass; it seems a bit imbalanced with so much more space to the sides, and with so much of the column/table on the bottom.  The reflection in the middle is also a little distracting.  I love the colours and the basics of the photo, though. 6</td>', 'I think I would have liked this one better with a tad more empty space above the glass; it seems a bit imbalanced with so much more space to the sides, and with so much of the column/table on the bottom.  The reflection in the middle is also a little distracting.  I love the colours and the basics of the photo, though. 6', '2004-08-05 19:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(845345, 94760, 23929, '<td valign="top">The blue could have been stronger.</td>', 'The blue could have been stronger.', '2004-08-05 19:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(845348, 94584, 16790, '<td valign="top">Yay, I love bottles!  Beautifully simplistic, and the composition is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Yay, I love bottles!  Beautifully simplistic, and the composition is very pleasing to the eye.', '2004-08-05 19:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(845350, 95043, 23929, '<td valign="top">Needs more blue or a brighter blue. Interesting piccy though.</td>', 'Needs more blue or a brighter blue. Interesting piccy though.', '2004-08-05 19:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(845355, 95081, 16790, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  So simple, and so sharp. 10</td>', 'Gorgeous.  So simple, and so sharp. 10', '2004-08-05 19:41:22.000000', NULL, 1);
