(846518, 94898, 7628, '<td valign="top">You got a nice "trompe d''oeille" effect - the tube seems to be sitting on top of the paper.  The framing adds to the effect.The color seems desaturated tho'' and the image isn''t quite sharp.  This could be fanastic with better lighting (this is a bit glaring and bright) and better focus and color)</td>', 'You got a nice "trompe d''oeille" effect - the tube seems to be sitting on top of the paper.  The framing adds to the effect.The color seems desaturated tho'' and the image isn''t quite sharp.  This could be fanastic with better lighting (this is a bit glaring and bright) and better focus and color)', '2004-08-06 12:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(846531, 95278, 15919, '<td valign="top">Dont cach my bye the first glance but when start looking at the reflection it gets much better.  Like it but maybe needs i litle more colorsaturation for my opinion.</td>', 'Dont cach my bye the first glance but when start looking at the reflection it gets much better.  Like it but maybe needs i litle more colorsaturation for my opinion.', '2004-08-06 13:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(846534, 95064, 7628, '<td valign="top">You have a nice range of blues here.  The light is a bit to glaring.  Perhaps more subtle lighting from one side with a "bounce" on the other side? or acouple of lights a different angles depending what you''d like to do with your shadows.  The image doesn''t seem quite sharp also - does you camera have a manual setting, sometimes the photographer''s eye is better than the camera''s.</td>', 'You have a nice range of blues here.  The light is a bit to glaring.  Perhaps more subtle lighting from one side with a "bounce" on the other side? or acouple of lights a different angles depending what you''d like to do with your shadows.  The image doesn''t seem quite sharp also - does you camera have a manual setting, sometimes the photographer''s eye is better than the camera''s.', '2004-08-06 13:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(846537, 95271, 15919, '<td valign="top">Have a hard time figuring this one out.  Since I cant get very exciting without some explanation I have to vote pretty low on this.</td>', 'Have a hard time figuring this one out.  Since I cant get very exciting without some explanation I have to vote pretty low on this.', '2004-08-06 13:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(846541, 95050, 7628, '<td valign="top">This makes an interesting abstract.  The vents at the bottom are sharp, and the metal makes nice reflections,  The flame is a great color blue.  Perhaps a greater DOF (longer exposure, smaller apature) would put the whole burner in focus and leave the flames blurred and impressionistic.  Might give more strength/impact to the image.</td>', 'This makes an interesting abstract.  The vents at the bottom are sharp, and the metal makes nice reflections,  The flame is a great color blue.  Perhaps a greater DOF (longer exposure, smaller apature) would put the whole burner in focus and leave the flames blurred and impressionistic.  Might give more strength/impact to the image.', '2004-08-06 13:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(846542, 95217, 15919, '<td valign="top">Seems your are experimenting in some way there and that´s a good thing.  On the other hand I think your experiment have gained you a rather negative result.  The flower (or is it not?) are very unsharp and not very exciting visually.  The background has some bluish eliments but is very noise and (sorry for saying it) ugly.  Also think the image needs thigter corping, expecially from below.</td>', 'Seems your are experimenting in some way there and that´s a good thing.  On the other hand I think your experiment have gained you a rather negative result.  The flower (or is it not?) are very unsharp and not very exciting visually.  The background has some bluish eliments but is very noise and (sorry for saying it) ugly.  Also think the image needs thigter corping, expecially from below.', '2004-08-06 13:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(846543, 94778, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like your subject.  I wish there were greater contrast between the subject and the background either by use of color or by lighting.</td>', 'I like your subject.  I wish there were greater contrast between the subject and the background either by use of color or by lighting.', '2004-08-06 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
