(846768, 94584, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hmm... This bottle looks familiar!  You''ve got a great deep blue and an interesting pattern in the reflection and a range of blues in the details.  It is a dariong composition with all that negative space.  I like it!  When the challenge is over it would be cool to see what burning in the shadow a bit does... might bring out some cool details, a bit more contrast.  9</td>', 'Hmm... This bottle looks familiar!  You''ve got a great deep blue and an interesting pattern in the reflection and a range of blues in the details.  It is a dariong composition with all that negative space.  I like it!  When the challenge is over it would be cool to see what burning in the shadow a bit does... might bring out some cool details, a bit more contrast.  9', '2004-08-06 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
