(846984, 94775, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is a a photo I''d definately want on my wall, it is a great street photo, but I just can''t place it in the blue challenge...    The shadow of the bike, and the moving people look so cool.  I assum eyou just have used a tripod for this, or some other support?  It''s intersting that the chap in white didn''t stop to look at you, which might have made the photo more interesting.  The range of tones and mixed colour temperatures (Green on the left I assume is a sodium light?) is all just too cool.  Well done.  I''m giving it a 9, even though it dosn''t meet the challenge, I really like it.</td>', 'This is a a photo I''d definately want on my wall, it is a great street photo, but I just can''t place it in the blue challenge...    The shadow of the bike, and the moving people look so cool.  I assum eyou just have used a tripod for this, or some other support?  It''s intersting that the chap in white didn''t stop to look at you, which might have made the photo more interesting.  The range of tones and mixed colour temperatures (Green on the left I assume is a sodium light?) is all just too cool.  Well done.  I''m giving it a 9, even though it dosn''t meet the challenge, I really like it.', '2004-08-06 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
