(847133, 94914, 20029, '<td valign="top">A few years back I made one of these! it was really fun except when you get the tingling feeling when they pull the newly made mask of you face off of your head, ouch! nice take on the challenge. its a bit dusty though, but other then that its great. 7</td>', 'A few years back I made one of these! it was really fun except when you get the tingling feeling when they pull the newly made mask of you face off of your head, ouch! nice take on the challenge. its a bit dusty though, but other then that its great. 7', '2004-08-06 21:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
