(847737, 95231, 23053, '<td valign="top">A tighter shot on the dye spreading through the water would have been more effective for me.  4.</td>', 'A tighter shot on the dye spreading through the water would have been more effective for me.  4.', '2004-08-07 09:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
