(848043, 94889, 18799, '<td valign="top">It just doesn''t look like you put much thought or effort into this entry.  The lamp is out of focus and crooked.  The blue light is overexposed.  I''m sorry, but I can''t rate this very high.   1</td>', 'It just doesn''t look like you put much thought or effort into this entry.  The lamp is out of focus and crooked.  The blue light is overexposed.  I''m sorry, but I can''t rate this very high.   1', '2004-08-07 14:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
