(848058, 95121, 24048, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Great composition, I really love the haze separating the close hills from the farther ones and the detail in the clouds is lovely!  Great job!  The only reason I''m not giving it a 10 is the horizon (shoreline?) isn''t straight.</td>', 'Nice!  Great composition, I really love the haze separating the close hills from the farther ones and the detail in the clouds is lovely!  Great job!  The only reason I''m not giving it a 10 is the horizon (shoreline?) isn''t straight.', '2004-08-07 14:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
