(848104, 94961, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. I''ll have to find out later how you got so close to this damsel fly.</td>', 'Well done. I''ll have to find out later how you got so close to this damsel fly.', '2004-08-07 15:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
