(848123, 95148, 19608, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT.  Composition, exposure, and focus are all "perfect."  Your blue is so vibrant it takes your breath away.</td>', 'EXCELLENT.  Composition, exposure, and focus are all "perfect."  Your blue is so vibrant it takes your breath away.', '2004-08-07 15:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(848125, 94692, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft and dark. I think the back lighting through blinds threw it a little off.</td>', 'A little soft and dark. I think the back lighting through blinds threw it a little off.', '2004-08-07 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(848129, 95217, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft, grainy and over processed. I like the composition with the shadows.</td>', 'A little soft, grainy and over processed. I like the composition with the shadows.', '2004-08-07 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(848134, 95056, 19608, '<td valign="top">The feather is a real WOW all the way.  Perfect composition, exposure and focus.  Your lighting brings out the intense colors exceptionally well.  Having said that, the heavy border is way too overbearing for me. If it needs a border at all (which I doubt) - I''d suggest a thin black one.  But the image itself is so strong, I see you in the top ten at least.</td>', 'The feather is a real WOW all the way.  Perfect composition, exposure and focus.  Your lighting brings out the intense colors exceptionally well.  Having said that, the heavy border is way too overbearing for me. If it needs a border at all (which I doubt) - I''d suggest a thin black one.  But the image itself is so strong, I see you in the top ten at least.', '2004-08-07 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(848141, 95148, 20613, '<td valign="top">amazing shot &amp; great idea!!! I love the angle...perfect focus!! 10!</td>', 'amazing shot & great idea!!! I love the angle...perfect focus!! 10!', '2004-08-07 15:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(848145, 94878, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional high-key portrait, graceful and charming.  The "hint" of the right foot is a great touch.  The white backgrund is perfect for the aqua blue dress.  The thin line as a border works fine but I wonder if it is needed.</td>', 'Exceptional high-key portrait, graceful and charming.  The "hint" of the right foot is a great touch.  The white backgrund is perfect for the aqua blue dress.  The thin line as a border works fine but I wonder if it is needed.', '2004-08-07 15:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(848161, 95255, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a great moon picture - very well exposed.  Unfortunately there is nothing that meets this requirement: "where the color blue is a major component of your entry."  The very tiny bit of blue on the top left quadrant of the moon is not a "major" component.</td>', 'This is a great moon picture - very well exposed.  Unfortunately there is nothing that meets this requirement: "where the color blue is a major component of your entry."  The very tiny bit of blue on the top left quadrant of the moon is not a "major" component.', '2004-08-07 15:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(848166, 95276, 19608, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of blue, but nothing very interesting.</td>', 'There is a lot of blue, but nothing very interesting.', '2004-08-07 15:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(848179, 94775, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptional image.  The long exposure really added some nice "ghost" figures.  The bike and especially its shadow are EXCEPTIONAL.  Now if only that red plastic sheet was blue instead of red, you''d have an image suitable for entry.  As it is, there is no major component of blue.</td>', 'This is an exceptional image.  The long exposure really added some nice "ghost" figures.  The bike and especially its shadow are EXCEPTIONAL.  Now if only that red plastic sheet was blue instead of red, you''d have an image suitable for entry.  As it is, there is no major component of blue.', '2004-08-07 15:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(848185, 95016, 19608, '<td valign="top">One of the better damselflies entered for sure!  Your insert is sharp and the background is exceptional.  Great job.</td>', 'One of the better damselflies entered for sure!  Your insert is sharp and the background is exceptional.  Great job.', '2004-08-07 15:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(848190, 94750, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a superb damselfly.  Great pose, great focus on the eyes.  The wings are delicate but perfectly focused too.  The background is very distracting - and, since this is advanced editing, could easily be toned down or blurred.</td>', 'This is a superb damselfly.  Great pose, great focus on the eyes.  The wings are delicate but perfectly focused too.  The background is very distracting - and, since this is advanced editing, could easily be toned down or blurred.', '2004-08-07 15:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(848192, 94863, 19608, '<td valign="top">You took an average building and made it look great - exceptional composition and rendering.   But, there is no major element of blue.</td>', 'You took an average building and made it look great - exceptional composition and rendering.   But, there is no major element of blue.', '2004-08-07 15:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(848194, 95051, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a very pleasing image,  peasefule/serene.   My first reaction to the white windows was that they overpower the image, but as I study it more, I really like them.  You have a border that is perfect, it does not distract yet holds the image together.</td>', 'This is a very pleasing image,  peasefule/serene.   My first reaction to the white windows was that they overpower the image, but as I study it more, I really like them.  You have a border that is perfect, it does not distract yet holds the image together.', '2004-08-07 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(848200, 94555, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle blue - excellent lighting.  The bottom of the image does not work,  unless that white band bewteen the black line and the border was put there for text or something.  Maybe rethink the need for a border at all.</td>', 'Nice subtle blue - excellent lighting.  The bottom of the image does not work,  unless that white band bewteen the black line and the border was put there for text or something.  Maybe rethink the need for a border at all.', '2004-08-07 15:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(848201, 95125, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject.  Excellent colors, including blue.  Perfect exposure and composition.  Border is not needed.</td>', 'Beautiful subject.  Excellent colors, including blue.  Perfect exposure and composition.  Border is not needed.', '2004-08-07 15:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(848203, 94809, 19608, '<td valign="top">It sure is blue!  The dead-cetered placement is pretty static.</td>', 'It sure is blue!  The dead-cetered placement is pretty static.', '2004-08-07 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(848204, 95165, 19608, '<td valign="top">Bravo. Well done!  This simple image should finish way up there.</td>', 'Bravo. Well done!  This simple image should finish way up there.', '2004-08-07 15:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(848205, 95216, 19608, '<td valign="top">Composition is good - lighting is ok.  On the down side, the B&amp;W image is really contrasty and it looks like the lips were done with a hue shift.  The piercing has to be uncomfotable.</td>', 'Composition is good - lighting is ok.  On the down side, the B&W image is really contrasty and it looks like the lips were done with a hue shift.  The piercing has to be uncomfotable.', '2004-08-07 15:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(848210, 94824, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great title and good seeing.  Nice lighting and use of space. My guess would be that its a peach.</td>', 'Great title and good seeing.  Nice lighting and use of space. My guess would be that its a peach.', '2004-08-07 16:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
