(848505, 94920, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent catch!  I''m sure some will complain that your "subject" isn''t blue - but your image SHOUTS blue all the way.  It meets the challenge without any doubt.     Exposure = perfect.  Compsition = near perfect in that it may need a little more space in front and less of the smoked-filled area.  Focus = Perfect.</td>', 'Excellent catch!  I''m sure some will complain that your "subject" isn''t blue - but your image SHOUTS blue all the way.  It meets the challenge without any doubt.     Exposure = perfect.  Compsition = near perfect in that it may need a little more space in front and less of the smoked-filled area.  Focus = Perfect.', '2004-08-07 23:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(848508, 94728, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have an excellent nature study.  The reflection is just perfect.  But please consider these changes:  1) Do you really need all the reflection or all of the mountain?  The horizon is so centered that one or the other should probably go away.  2) The exposure is probably technically "right on" but the image may look a liitle better if the colors were more saturated.</td>', 'You have an excellent nature study.  The reflection is just perfect.  But please consider these changes:  1) Do you really need all the reflection or all of the mountain?  The horizon is so centered that one or the other should probably go away.  2) The exposure is probably technically "right on" but the image may look a liitle better if the colors were more saturated.', '2004-08-07 23:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(848510, 95260, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb photo.  I love everything about it except for the border (and what''s with the extra white band at the bottom of the border?)  The hint of green in the shadow of the glass is great.  The lighting is superb - especially the gradation from orange to white in the background - top left.  Keep up the nice work.</td>', 'Superb photo.  I love everything about it except for the border (and what''s with the extra white band at the bottom of the border?)  The hint of green in the shadow of the glass is great.  The lighting is superb - especially the gradation from orange to white in the background - top left.  Keep up the nice work.', '2004-08-07 23:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(848533, 95127, 24494, '<td valign="top">i love this shot but not the blue behind the trees great shat</td>', 'i love this shot but not the blue behind the trees great shat', '2004-08-08 00:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(848541, 94783, 16493, '<td valign="top">very good detail, bit more light on the eyes</td>', 'very good detail, bit more light on the eyes', '2004-08-08 00:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(848544, 94878, 16493, '<td valign="top">excelent picture, good detail.</td>', 'excelent picture, good detail.', '2004-08-08 00:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(848584, 95300, 11800, '<td valign="top">There isn''t much wrong with the technique used to take this picture other than the highlights being blown. It is blue also. I can see how well you got everything all lined up in the frame. Personally, it looks more like a scanned picture, as in the bottle was placed on the scanner and a "picture" taken of it. I don''t think there is enough in the picture for it to be entertaining.</td>', 'There isn''t much wrong with the technique used to take this picture other than the highlights being blown. It is blue also. I can see how well you got everything all lined up in the frame. Personally, it looks more like a scanned picture, as in the bottle was placed on the scanner and a "picture" taken of it. I don''t think there is enough in the picture for it to be entertaining.', '2004-08-08 01:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(848587, 95320, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great focal point</td>', 'Great focal point', '2004-08-08 01:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(848590, 95128, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great concept and execution.</td>', 'Great concept and execution.', '2004-08-08 01:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(848593, 94889, 11800, '<td valign="top">The picture is fuzzy from lack of focus.  All the space around the lamp doesn''t add to the composition and could have been eliminated by moving closer to the subject. Try to avoid over use of neat image. Sorry for being so negative.</td>', 'The picture is fuzzy from lack of focus.  All the space around the lamp doesn''t add to the composition and could have been eliminated by moving closer to the subject. Try to avoid over use of neat image. Sorry for being so negative.', '2004-08-08 01:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(848601, 95334, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wish there was something else to add interest to the picture. I don''t think the darkness around the edges add anything to the image. Please don''t let this comment discourage you. Everyone sees things differently.</td>', 'Wish there was something else to add interest to the picture. I don''t think the darkness around the edges add anything to the image. Please don''t let this comment discourage you. Everyone sees things differently.', '2004-08-08 01:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(848602, 94738, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  The selective desat really works well here.  The wind was really blowing!</td>', 'Very cute!  The selective desat really works well here.  The wind was really blowing!', '2004-08-08 01:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(848605, 95093, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional portrait.  Exposure, composition and rendering is great.  The use of selective desat and sepia-like tones works very well.</td>', 'Exceptional portrait.  Exposure, composition and rendering is great.  The use of selective desat and sepia-like tones works very well.', '2004-08-08 01:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(848608, 94942, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  The folds in the red cloth add a lot to the composition.</td>', 'Great colors.  The folds in the red cloth add a lot to the composition.', '2004-08-08 01:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(848613, 94813, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Your black background may have let you down a little. You have isolated the wooded part of the handle which intended or not does help to highlight the blue steel and the front sight has almost disappeared.</td>', 'Good concept. Your black background may have let you down a little. You have isolated the wooded part of the handle which intended or not does help to highlight the blue steel and the front sight has almost disappeared.', '2004-08-08 01:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(848616, 94781, 24486, '<td valign="top">Clever concept. Great perspective</td>', 'Clever concept. Great perspective', '2004-08-08 01:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(848617, 95064, 11800, '<td valign="top">You might find that voters like clean precise compositions. The idea of the photo was valid enough and can still lead to an exploration of the subject. This photo looks too cluttered and is not arranged in a pleasing fashion. I would suggest picking two items that have a relationship to each other, say the stapler and ruler, and working on different compositions just using them. When you have a pleasing shot, add another item. Try not to use more than 3 objects. Good luck.</td>', 'You might find that voters like clean precise compositions. The idea of the photo was valid enough and can still lead to an exploration of the subject. This photo looks too cluttered and is not arranged in a pleasing fashion. I would suggest picking two items that have a relationship to each other, say the stapler and ruler, and working on different compositions just using them. When you have a pleasing shot, add another item. Try not to use more than 3 objects. Good luck.', '2004-08-08 01:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(848623, 94529, 22659, '<td valign="top">I think maybe this pic calls for a desaturation. When I look at it, I see shoes, not blue. Really great picture though. Good eye!</td>', 'I think maybe this pic calls for a desaturation. When I look at it, I see shoes, not blue. Really great picture though. Good eye!', '2004-08-08 01:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(848624, 94621, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great perspective</td>', 'Great perspective', '2004-08-08 01:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(848628, 95280, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great concept and perspective</td>', 'Great concept and perspective', '2004-08-08 01:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(848631, 94804, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, which has nothing to do with anything you might say, but part of the enjoyment of photography for me is seeing something I know photographed well. So, since I don''t know what this is, I feel no connection to it and don''t find it interesting. If it was closer and made into an abstract I would probably like it though. Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, which has nothing to do with anything you might say, but part of the enjoyment of photography for me is seeing something I know photographed well. So, since I don''t know what this is, I feel no connection to it and don''t find it interesting. If it was closer and made into an abstract I would probably like it though. Sorry.', '2004-08-08 01:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(848639, 95276, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s oof. The reflection isn''t strong enough for it to be considered a part of the composition and by trying to include it the picture looks imbalanced. It''s a good idea. Maybe try moving around till a more clear reflection is created would help if you try it again.</td>', 'It''s oof. The reflection isn''t strong enough for it to be considered a part of the composition and by trying to include it the picture looks imbalanced. It''s a good idea. Maybe try moving around till a more clear reflection is created would help if you try it again.', '2004-08-08 01:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(848673, 94678, 19608, '<td valign="top">The idea and lighting on this is superb.  It would be a 10 if there was a recognisable fish silhouette.  The spots above the hand are unfortunate.</td>', 'The idea and lighting on this is superb.  It would be a 10 if there was a recognisable fish silhouette.  The spots above the hand are unfortunate.', '2004-08-08 02:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(848675, 94936, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors and black background are great.  The unnatural color of the leaves makes it seem like it''s only for the blue challenge.</td>', 'The colors and black background are great.  The unnatural color of the leaves makes it seem like it''s only for the blue challenge.', '2004-08-08 02:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(848676, 95093, 19936, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity, select use of color, lighting and subject!  How could we resist?  My top choice.</td>', 'I love the clarity, select use of color, lighting and subject!  How could we resist?  My top choice.', '2004-08-08 02:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(848680, 94704, 19608, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of blue, but your image is way to small to get a good feel for it,</td>', 'There''s a lot of blue, but your image is way to small to get a good feel for it,', '2004-08-08 02:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
