(848683, 95061, 19936, '<td valign="top">This was a great shot. If not for the slight washout at the bottom it would have been right up there with my top choice, but it is still in my top five.  It exudes refreshment and makes me want to right out and find a cold glass and .....</td>', 'This was a great shot. If not for the slight washout at the bottom it would have been right up there with my top choice, but it is still in my top five.  It exudes refreshment and makes me want to right out and find a cold glass and .....', '2004-08-08 02:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
