(849550, 95271, 12252, '<td valign="top">You''ve met the challenge but there isn''t too much to hold my interest in this image. The shapes are nice, but the bottlie is out of focus and that''s where my eye wants to rest but can''t, because of the focus issues. &lt;&lt;5&gt;&gt;</td>', 'You''ve met the challenge but there isn''t too much to hold my interest in this image. The shapes are nice, but the bottlie is out of focus and that''s where my eye wants to rest but can''t, because of the focus issues. <<5>>', '2004-08-08 21:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(849556, 94778, 24595, '<td valign="top">Blue overdose.</td>', 'Blue overdose.', '2004-08-08 21:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(849557, 95036, 12252, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge with the blue sky but otherwise, the image lacks some ooomph. Maybe get even lower and look up even higher at the hoop? Maybe get a ball about to go into the basket? Not sure, but it needs something more here... &lt;&lt;5&gt;&gt;</td>', 'Meets the challenge with the blue sky but otherwise, the image lacks some ooomph. Maybe get even lower and look up even higher at the hoop? Maybe get a ball about to go into the basket? Not sure, but it needs something more here... <<5>>', '2004-08-08 21:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(849559, 94687, 12252, '<td valign="top">Love it. Good idea, and nicely composed with the unusual angle on the keyboard.</td>', 'Love it. Good idea, and nicely composed with the unusual angle on the keyboard.', '2004-08-08 21:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(849564, 95200, 24970, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty, but where is the blue?</td>', 'It''s pretty, but where is the blue?', '2004-08-08 21:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(849565, 95273, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I wonder if you looked as silly as I did, trying to make a shot like this. (Mine was a pair of shoes, and not for this challenge.) In your image, the sky looks a little odd like perhaps you saturated it a bit? The clouds lack a certain whiteness. Otherwise, good stuff.</td>', 'Nicely done. I wonder if you looked as silly as I did, trying to make a shot like this. (Mine was a pair of shoes, and not for this challenge.) In your image, the sky looks a little odd like perhaps you saturated it a bit? The clouds lack a certain whiteness. Otherwise, good stuff.', '2004-08-08 21:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(849568, 95025, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. A little more focus in the foreground would be nice.</td>', 'Very interesting. A little more focus in the foreground would be nice.', '2004-08-08 21:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(849569, 95046, 12252, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge, pretty good focus but it falls off in the corners. If it were me, I''d have the columns lined up perfectly parallel to the sides of the frame.</td>', 'Meets challenge, pretty good focus but it falls off in the corners. If it were me, I''d have the columns lined up perfectly parallel to the sides of the frame.', '2004-08-08 21:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(849572, 95222, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well done. I''d like to see it without shadow and the focus on the die is just a bit soft to my eye, although it''s a tough subject being translucent plastic. Maybe try turning the top die just a bit for contrast?</td>', 'Nice idea, well done. I''d like to see it without shadow and the focus on the die is just a bit soft to my eye, although it''s a tough subject being translucent plastic. Maybe try turning the top die just a bit for contrast?', '2004-08-08 21:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(849575, 94778, 12252, '<td valign="top">Yes you met the challenge, and the composition is creative. That said, the blue appears to be too saturated to me, and my eye is distracted by the blown highlights on the legs of the jacks. Practice with other lighting positions to see what happens, and maybe even moving the jacks to a non-symmetrical position would create some more interest as well.</td>', 'Yes you met the challenge, and the composition is creative. That said, the blue appears to be too saturated to me, and my eye is distracted by the blown highlights on the legs of the jacks. Practice with other lighting positions to see what happens, and maybe even moving the jacks to a non-symmetrical position would create some more interest as well.', '2004-08-08 21:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(849593, 95125, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad that the focus on her hands is off.</td>', 'Too bad that the focus on her hands is off.', '2004-08-08 21:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(849598, 94961, 11738, '<td valign="top">bad crop</td>', 'bad crop', '2004-08-08 22:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(849601, 94720, 6405, '<td valign="top">Lovely,10 !</td>', 'Lovely,10 !', '2004-08-08 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(849618, 94711, 24976, '<td valign="top">its a bit out of focus in some parts of the lorikeet</td>', 'its a bit out of focus in some parts of the lorikeet', '2004-08-08 22:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(849627, 94555, 12131, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Would like to se the small glass a little more in focus but lines are excellent, the titles funny and I like the optical illusion created by the middle of the three tall glasses.  Looks like its both in from and behind. 9</td>', 'Love it.  Would like to se the small glass a little more in focus but lines are excellent, the titles funny and I like the optical illusion created by the middle of the three tall glasses.  Looks like its both in from and behind. 9', '2004-08-08 22:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(849634, 95159, 12131, '<td valign="top">What kind of bird did that come from?  Beautiful feather, I like the slow and smooth transition from white to blue.</td>', 'What kind of bird did that come from?  Beautiful feather, I like the slow and smooth transition from white to blue.', '2004-08-08 22:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(849635, 95023, 12131, '<td valign="top">I love pictures like this.  It really kind of enhances the main subject.</td>', 'I love pictures like this.  It really kind of enhances the main subject.', '2004-08-08 22:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
