(849724, 94837, 25204, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot. A lot of Emotion in this photo even though it is a statue. I love what you''ve done with the background.</td>', 'Nice Shot. A lot of Emotion in this photo even though it is a statue. I love what you''ve done with the background.', '2004-08-08 23:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
