(849837, 94551, 15920, '<td valign="top">This isn''t very blue on my monitor.  Regardless of that, there is a fair bit of noise that the trial version of Neat Image might clean up.  Good idea though, and a good candidate for the centered composition that you chose.</td>', 'This isn''t very blue on my monitor.  Regardless of that, there is a fair bit of noise that the trial version of Neat Image might clean up.  Good idea though, and a good candidate for the centered composition that you chose.', '2004-08-09 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
