(850060, 95016, 22734, '<td valign="top">Jacko: with blues back to back i suggest you open the vintage wine. This is the time. My warm congratulations on this amazing feat.</td>', 'Jacko: with blues back to back i suggest you open the vintage wine. This is the time. My warm congratulations on this amazing feat.', '2004-08-09 01:55:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(850098, 95061, 22748, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jenesis:</b></div><hr/><i>The horizon looks level but the bottle seems slightly tilted to me.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think that''s just perspective distortion from the wide-angle lens, probably a 14-18mm lens, I would guess.</td>', 'Originally posted by jenesis:The horizon looks level but the bottle seems slightly tilted to me.  I think that''s just perspective distortion from the wide-angle lens, probably a 14-18mm lens, I would guess.', '2004-08-09 02:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(850101, 94803, 22734, '<td valign="top">For those who requested info: This is my "Cabaret" version of Blue Moon, hence the stage lighting and fake moon. I am sorry to those who expected the classic mood shot. I opted for the cabaret interpretation. I love the lighting produced by stage lights and I knew the prejudice against using the fake moon...but that is who I am, sorry. <br/> <br/>The moon is a lamp. The background was muslin stretched and sprayed black and sand thrown on wet paint for gritty texture. Lit with bounced strobe off shinny blue material. Second strobe near ground bounced off light purple material. Moon was light with black light. basically a self portrait.</td>', 'For those who requested info: This is my "Cabaret" version of Blue Moon, hence the stage lighting and fake moon. I am sorry to those who expected the classic mood shot. I opted for the cabaret interpretation. I love the lighting produced by stage lights and I knew the prejudice against using the fake moon...but that is who I am, sorry.  The moon is a lamp. The background was muslin stretched and sprayed black and sand thrown on wet paint for gritty texture. Lit with bounced strobe off shinny blue material. Second strobe near ground bounced off light purple material. Moon was light with black light. basically a self portrait.', '2004-08-09 02:07:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(850107, 94799, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 2nd placing. Indeed a magical image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 2nd placing. Indeed a magical image.', '2004-08-09 02:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(850110, 94920, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your yellow. A very action packed image with great colors and clarity. Amazing shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your yellow. A very action packed image with great colors and clarity. Amazing shot.', '2004-08-09 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
