(850165, 94687, 255, '<td valign="top">ah the elusive blue note! so tough on a piano, at least for me! :)  very crisp shot and technically well done lighting--which ironically is the only thing i might like to see done differently...when i think of blue note, i think of dark, smoky, velvety jazz/blues/swing clubs where the lighting is as cool and hip as the music. maybe a little more subtle, less even lighting would work for this shot as well--highlighting the ''blue note'', but still giving a little more atmosphere. make sense? :) great idea, and very nicely done shot.</td>', 'ah the elusive blue note! so tough on a piano, at least for me! :)  very crisp shot and technically well done lighting--which ironically is the only thing i might like to see done differently...when i think of blue note, i think of dark, smoky, velvety jazz/blues/swing clubs where the lighting is as cool and hip as the music. maybe a little more subtle, less even lighting would work for this shot as well--highlighting the ''blue note'', but still giving a little more atmosphere. make sense? :) great idea, and very nicely done shot.', '2004-08-09 02:29:16.000000', NULL, 0),
