(851077, 94878, 20056, '<td valign="top">Congrats for the position... It is amazing how different points of view people can have: what for me it is an artificial, forced and rigid composition (that is why I do not see it elegant), for others it is meaningful.<br/> <br/>I repeat my comments: colors combination is perfect... but I do not get the feeling of elegance from the picture; my fault :)<br/> <br/>As Kiwiness said : do not take too much seriously my comments... not at all. Let''s continue enjoying photographs.</td>', 'Congrats for the position... It is amazing how different points of view people can have: what for me it is an artificial, forced and rigid composition (that is why I do not see it elegant), for others it is meaningful. I repeat my comments: colors combination is perfect... but I do not get the feeling of elegance from the picture; my fault :) As Kiwiness said : do not take too much seriously my comments... not at all. Let''s continue enjoying photographs.', '2004-08-09 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 0),
