(852128, 95159, 2553, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this shot "re-done" with better lighting to bring out the blue, a nice crisp white background, and a bit more of a dynamic composition.  I love the softness, though, and wouldn''t change that - it really gives the downy feathery bits at the root end a lovely feel.<br/> <br/>Sorry that I didn''t get a chance to comment during the challenge, but was just going through the shots and this caught my eye.</td>', 'Would love to see this shot "re-done" with better lighting to bring out the blue, a nice crisp white background, and a bit more of a dynamic composition.  I love the softness, though, and wouldn''t change that - it really gives the downy feathery bits at the root end a lovely feel. Sorry that I didn''t get a chance to comment during the challenge, but was just going through the shots and this caught my eye.', '2004-08-10 05:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(852269, 94799, 13384, '<td valign="top">I would like to take this personal time to thank you for the great comments you left on my Once in a Blue Moon entry [the Edge of Night].  I have enjoyed this site a great deal and am honored to have finally captured a widely appreicated image as I appreciate the opportunities of the DPC site.<br/> <br/>Thank you again and best of efforts to you too,<br/> <br/>John</td>', 'I would like to take this personal time to thank you for the great comments you left on my Once in a Blue Moon entry [the Edge of Night].  I have enjoyed this site a great deal and am honored to have finally captured a widely appreicated image as I appreciate the opportunities of the DPC site. Thank you again and best of efforts to you too, John', '2004-08-10 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
