(855146, 95207, 7322, '<td valign="top">I have an Aussie with mottled blue/brown eyes. I wish I could get a good shot of her eyes but even at the age of 9 she''s a bit of a spaz. This is an interesting photo but I would like to see more of the dog''s face. Just this view of the pale eye and the surrounding skin is rather creepy looking.</td>', 'I have an Aussie with mottled blue/brown eyes. I wish I could get a good shot of her eyes but even at the age of 9 she''s a bit of a spaz. This is an interesting photo but I would like to see more of the dog''s face. Just this view of the pale eye and the surrounding skin is rather creepy looking.', '2004-08-11 15:18:25.000000', NULL, 0),
