(879109, 95061, 10702, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skylen:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jenesis:</b></div><hr/><i>The horizon looks level but the bottle seems slightly tilted to me.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think that''s just perspective distortion from the wide-angle lens, probably a 14-18mm lens, I would guess. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Also I would think that the glass fools the eye a little bit because the vertical line in it tilts a bit</td>', 'Originally posted by skylen: Originally posted by jenesis:The horizon looks level but the bottle seems slightly tilted to me.  I think that''s just perspective distortion from the wide-angle lens, probably a 14-18mm lens, I would guess.   Also I would think that the glass fools the eye a little bit because the vertical line in it tilts a bit', '2004-08-26 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
