(1588377, 94774, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. . . I really like this!    I''m always drawn to blue, but this has such a cool (temperature cool) look to it.    Very awesome!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ooooh. . . I really like this!    I''m always drawn to blue, but this has such a cool (temperature cool) look to it.    Very awesome! ', '2005-08-05 08:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
