(4306433, 94533, 87278, '<td valign="top">Very touching. Death is the most common event for all life forms but when a loved one dies it is in a way once in a blue moon event. Thank whatever-you-believe-in it remains just that!<br/> <br/>Indeed a unique tribute! Across time and place, here comes commiseration. May her memory live with you till the blue yonder.</td>', 'Very touching. Death is the most common event for all life forms but when a loved one dies it is in a way once in a blue moon event. Thank whatever-you-believe-in it remains just that! Indeed a unique tribute! Across time and place, here comes commiseration. May her memory live with you till the blue yonder.', '2007-12-10 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
